(139185, 6939, 4596, '<td valign="top">Sorry... there is too much innocence involved here for it to be truly sinful. Children, even those who do go beyond proud, are symbolic of innocence not greed. It would be very hard to pull off otherwise, although I suppose two sisters tugging at a trophy would do it. This is just a pleasant shot of a proud kid reflecting innocence and wanting recognition and approvl. Give her a hug.</td>', 'Sorry... there is too much innocence involved here for it to be truly sinful. Children, even those who do go beyond proud, are symbolic of innocence not greed. It would be very hard to pull off otherwise, although I suppose two sisters tugging at a trophy would do it. This is just a pleasant shot of a proud kid reflecting innocence and wanting recognition and approvl. Give her a hug.', '2002-10-14 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
