(139190, 6939, 4388, '<td valign="top">not sinful at all to me.</td>', 'not sinful at all to me.', '2002-10-14 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139191, 6939, 3002, '<td valign="top">this is too cute for a ''seven deadly sins'' challenge, but it''s your photo.  Cute.</td>', 'this is too cute for a ''seven deadly sins'' challenge, but it''s your photo.  Cute.', '2002-10-15 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139192, 6939, 3080, '<td valign="top">Excelent shot.  Definately captures pride at it''s best.  I love that she''s wearing a soccer shirt, as well as holding the soccer trophy.  Her smile says it all.  I think that the background could be better, but under the circumstances, it''s ok.  You have blurred it enough, that it doesn''t take much from the photo at all.  Only the white cup near her head really stands out, and even that is no big deal.  Lighting on the girl and her trophy is great.  Angle and framing/cropping are also very nice.  Great shot. 8 Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Excelent shot.  Definately captures pride at it''s best.  I love that she''s wearing a soccer shirt, as well as holding the soccer trophy.  Her smile says it all.  I think that the background could be better, but under the circumstances, it''s ok.  You have blurred it enough, that it doesn''t take much from the photo at all.  Only the white cup near her head really stands out, and even that is no big deal.  Lighting on the girl and her trophy is great.  Angle and framing/cropping are also very nice.  Great shot. 8 Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-15 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139193, 6939, 4007, '<td valign="top">cute kid, neat home photo.. but.. that''s all.  Nothing that draws me in.  2 wingy</td>', 'cute kid, neat home photo.. but.. that''s all.  Nothing that draws me in.  2 wingy', '2002-10-15 02:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139194, 6939, 3859, '<td valign="top">A precious photo and if she won this trophy, she should be proud. I don''t think that kind of pride is what is considered a deadly sin.  And I definitely see nothing sinful implied or shown in this photo.</td>', 'A precious photo and if she won this trophy, she should be proud. I don''t think that kind of pride is what is considered a deadly sin.  And I definitely see nothing sinful implied or shown in this photo.', '2002-10-15 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139195, 6939, 4378, '<td valign="top">owwwww! heartwarming isn''t it? nice work Martha Stewart!</td>', 'owwwww! heartwarming isn''t it? nice work Martha Stewart!', '2002-10-15 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139196, 6939, 2337, '<td valign="top">Cute expression and very cute model... The background could have used a little more thought though... There seems to be a white (cup?) thing growing out of her left ear.  A blank background (or even better, a soccer field) would have helped this shot tremndously...  I almost wanted to give you a hard time about meeting the challenge since a child''s pride in their accomplishments is not actually what is refereed to in the ''7 deadly sins''... But then I realized (though I could be wrong) that it is your pride in her and not her pride that you are referring to here.  While that could be debated as not a sin either, it certainly could be if misdirected... So I give you full points for on challenge + 1 extra for a unique, thoughtful way of expressing it. ~MyQyl~<br/><br/>By the way, tell her I said Congratulations!!!</td>', 'Cute expression and very cute model... The background could have used a little more thought though... There seems to be a white (cup?) thing growing out of her left ear.  A blank background (or even better, a soccer field) would have helped this shot tremndously...  I almost wanted to give you a hard time about meeting the challenge since a child''s pride in their accomplishments is not actually what is refereed to in the ''7 deadly sins''... But then I realized (though I could be wrong) that it is your pride in her and not her pride that you are referring to here.  While that could be debated as not a sin either, it certainly could be if misdirected... So I give you full points for on challenge + 1 extra for a unique, thoughtful way of expressing it. ~MyQyl~By the way, tell her I said Congratulations!!!', '2002-10-15 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139197, 6939, 2490, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast with the idea of "sin", as this fine little person appears so innocent :-)  Pride of this nature I think is great, not sinful.  5 nards656</td>', 'Nice contrast with the idea of "sin", as this fine little person appears so innocent :-)  Pride of this nature I think is great, not sinful.  5 nards656', '2002-10-15 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139198, 6939, 4615, '<td valign="top">But not pride in the sinful sense, more joy.</td>', 'But not pride in the sinful sense, more joy.', '2002-10-16 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139199, 6939, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this pride is a sin, but doggonnit, it is pride.  The judges accept.</td>', 'I don''t think this pride is a sin, but doggonnit, it is pride.  The judges accept.', '2002-10-16 06:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139200, 6939, 2643, '<td valign="top">her dilated pupils show more to me than anything else in the picture...she most certainly is very proud!</td>', 'her dilated pupils show more to me than anything else in the picture...she most certainly is very proud!', '2002-10-16 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139201, 6939, 4539, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually rate photo''s highly that are just of a kid, but this one is an exception.  Her eyes are unbelievable and there is the unquestioning look of pride.  Rated 8.</td>', 'I don''t usually rate photo''s highly that are just of a kid, but this one is an exception.  Her eyes are unbelievable and there is the unquestioning look of pride.  Rated 8.', '2002-10-16 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
