(139207, 6939, 4007, '<td valign="top">Hey.. I just wanted to ask you to please forgive my initial harshness.  A 2 was a bit low for this shot.  I think the photo still relies on a lot of cute value and therefore is an extremely valueable shot yet more suited for a family album than a public forum.  However, there is depth here that I failed to acknowledge before.  A 5 is probably more in line with this shot than the 2 I originally gave.  I think it was so stinkin cute I originally discredited the shot for that reason.</td>', 'Hey.. I just wanted to ask you to please forgive my initial harshness.  A 2 was a bit low for this shot.  I think the photo still relies on a lot of cute value and therefore is an extremely valueable shot yet more suited for a family album than a public forum.  However, there is depth here that I failed to acknowledge before.  A 5 is probably more in line with this shot than the 2 I originally gave.  I think it was so stinkin cute I originally discredited the shot for that reason.', '2002-10-21 03:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
