(139271, 6943, 1856, '<td valign="top">And president to some as well :P  Great framing and composition.  Especially nice that you caught him looking in your general direction.  Clever use of well known political figure to embody the sins we all possess to some degree.  9 Lisa</td>', 'And president to some as well :P  Great framing and composition.  Especially nice that you caught him looking in your general direction.  Clever use of well known political figure to embody the sins we all possess to some degree.  9 Lisa', '2002-10-14 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139272, 6943, 4494, '<td valign="top">:p  Your pic sucks.</td>', ':p  Your pic sucks.', '2002-10-14 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139273, 6943, 4388, '<td valign="top">i understand what you are saying, but...</td>', 'i understand what you are saying, but...', '2002-10-14 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139274, 6943, 1827, '<td valign="top">Well, I for one think all three.  And I take it as pride in the sinful sense, not the I''m proud of my country sense.  &amp;lt;/me edits all her political opinions out of your comment.  :-)&amp;gt;   6, just-married</td>', 'Well, I for one think all three.  And I take it as pride in the sinful sense, not the I''m proud of my country sense.  &lt;/me edits all her political opinions out of your comment.  :-)&gt;   6, just-married', '2002-10-14 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139275, 6943, 2009, '<td valign="top">Composition 9<br/>Technique 10<br/>Challenge 10<br/>Apeal 8</td>', 'Composition 9Technique 10Challenge 10Apeal 8', '2002-10-15 00:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139276, 6943, 4430, '<td valign="top">This is a great pic, who cares how it was taken!!!!! Is there a rule or something that this has to be taken in person?</td>', 'This is a great pic, who cares how it was taken!!!!! Is there a rule or something that this has to be taken in person?', '2002-10-15 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139277, 6943, 3932, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love the intensity that you captured.  What did you do to make him look right at you??? :)  The photo is very well composed.  You did a nice job of cropping him.  He''s in a good location, and none of his body is cut off through the crop.  The angle that you took the shot at provides a nice background with some visuals... it looks like if you would have been more straight on for the shot, Bush would have blended right in with the background.  Superb job - 10  -  JB</td>', 'Great shot.  I love the intensity that you captured.  What did you do to make him look right at you??? :)  The photo is very well composed.  You did a nice job of cropping him.  He''s in a good location, and none of his body is cut off through the crop.  The angle that you took the shot at provides a nice background with some visuals... it looks like if you would have been more straight on for the shot, Bush would have blended right in with the background.  Superb job - 10  -  JB', '2002-10-15 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139278, 6943, 4007, '<td valign="top">Interesting editorial to make people think.. the photo itself has good composition.  However, the shot doesn''t have much visual appeal for me.  Might go nicely with a news article, but as a stand alone photo it just doesn''t pack much punch. 4</td>', 'Interesting editorial to make people think.. the photo itself has good composition.  However, the shot doesn''t have much visual appeal for me.  Might go nicely with a news article, but as a stand alone photo it just doesn''t pack much punch. 4', '2002-10-15 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139279, 6943, 2717, '<td valign="top">My man!!  8 Frank</td>', 'My man!!  8 Frank', '2002-10-15 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139280, 6943, 1696, '<td valign="top">I hate this dude.</td>', 'I hate this dude.', '2002-10-15 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139281, 6943, 2337, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it was intentional, but the pole/rail that runs into the back of his neck gives him a puppet/inhuman look that works well with me.  You caught a great expression...  Extra point for a unique, fresh interpetation of the challenge :)</td>', 'I don''t know if it was intentional, but the pole/rail that runs into the back of his neck gives him a puppet/inhuman look that works well with me.  You caught a great expression...  Extra point for a unique, fresh interpetation of the challenge :)', '2002-10-15 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139282, 6943, 4378, '<td valign="top">you''re kidding right?</td>', 'you''re kidding right?', '2002-10-15 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139283, 6943, 4411, '<td valign="top">Seeing that you were able to get in a position to take this gives me an idea of how good some of the photographers I''m up against are. My experience with a (real) camera stretches all of 6 weeks!<br/>So which is he to you? Unfortunately I live in the "rest of the world" where the latter is more applicable.<br/>Nevertheless, an excellent photo. Well done.</td>', 'Seeing that you were able to get in a position to take this gives me an idea of how good some of the photographers I''m up against are. My experience with a (real) camera stretches all of 6 weeks!So which is he to you? Unfortunately I live in the "rest of the world" where the latter is more applicable.Nevertheless, an excellent photo. Well done.', '2002-10-15 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139284, 6943, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great color!  What''s the flag in the background?  Lucky? you, I''ve never been in the presence of a U.S. President.   (But I did have Ford''s signature at one time)<br/>9 Swash</td>', 'Great color!  What''s the flag in the background?  Lucky? you, I''ve never been in the presence of a U.S. President.   (But I did have Ford''s signature at one time)9 Swash', '2002-10-15 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139285, 6943, 1897, '<td valign="top">I do not see an overt display of any of those characteristics.  Now if you could have gotten a shot of Clinton,  that would be a great one for llust.  Zeiss</td>', 'I do not see an overt display of any of those characteristics.  Now if you could have gotten a shot of Clinton,  that would be a great one for llust.  Zeiss', '2002-10-15 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
