(139311, 6944, 4564, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this idea. Unfortunatly, I feel the shot does not do justice to your idea.  I wonder what other ways this idea could have been used in order to make it visually more interesting.  But I love its statement.  Better lighting maybe?  Or a closer look?  Or interaction with someone?  I don''t know...  7/10 for originality... would have been a 10 if the shot had been perfect.</td>', 'I LOVE this idea. Unfortunatly, I feel the shot does not do justice to your idea.  I wonder what other ways this idea could have been used in order to make it visually more interesting.  But I love its statement.  Better lighting maybe?  Or a closer look?  Or interaction with someone?  I don''t know...  7/10 for originality... would have been a 10 if the shot had been perfect.', '2002-10-14 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
