(139441, 6949, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''ll have to revisit this later in the week and see if I can find the tie in to ''7 deadly sins''... But topic aside, it''s a very nice shot... One small nitpick if I may = the horizon is slanted to the left just enough to be distracting.  At least to me.  Also the TV antenna''s on the right doesn''t add much for me... If I''m missing something obvious topicwise, please feel free to PM me if you want. ~MyQyl~</td>', 'I''ll have to revisit this later in the week and see if I can find the tie in to ''7 deadly sins''... But topic aside, it''s a very nice shot... One small nitpick if I may = the horizon is slanted to the left just enough to be distracting.  At least to me.  Also the TV antenna''s on the right doesn''t add much for me... If I''m missing something obvious topicwise, please feel free to PM me if you want. ~MyQyl~', '2002-10-15 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139442, 6949, 4007, '<td valign="top">the lens flare is neat and well placed but the subject doesn''t really attract me much.  I''m actually more drawn the the shadowed figure on the bottom left than I am to the sun or the building in this shot. neat shot, but it just doesn''t do much for me. 6</td>', 'the lens flare is neat and well placed but the subject doesn''t really attract me much.  I''m actually more drawn the the shadowed figure on the bottom left than I am to the sun or the building in this shot. neat shot, but it just doesn''t do much for me. 6', '2002-10-15 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139443, 6949, 2490, '<td valign="top">A bright light it was, too!  Overall, I would have taken the brightness down, and it would have stopped the "overexposed" look, even though that may have been intentional.  Sin redeemed, good thought.  Tighter crop would have eliminated scaffolding or whatever at lower right. 6 nards656</td>', 'A bright light it was, too!  Overall, I would have taken the brightness down, and it would have stopped the "overexposed" look, even though that may have been intentional.  Sin redeemed, good thought.  Tighter crop would have eliminated scaffolding or whatever at lower right. 6 nards656', '2002-10-15 23:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139444, 6949, 3540, '<td valign="top">Too much noise.  There''s gotta be a sweet spot somewhere that''s not so bright.  Nicely framed shot. though.</td>', 'Too much noise.  There''s gotta be a sweet spot somewhere that''s not so bright.  Nicely framed shot. though.', '2002-10-16 06:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
