(139567, 6959, 917, '<td valign="top">I like the attempt to be different, but the photography needs work. Try experimenting with the strong diagonals you have here a bit more.<br/><br/>Also the blood looks fake (and yes, I suspect its real), I use a thick acrylic paint.<br/><br/>There is a problem with the lights reflecting off the liquid, try using a diffuse source.<br/><br/>Also, use a model, then you can concentrate on the photography.<br/><br/>And see a doctor.</td>', 'I like the attempt to be different, but the photography needs work. Try experimenting with the strong diagonals you have here a bit more.Also the blood looks fake (and yes, I suspect its real), I use a thick acrylic paint.There is a problem with the lights reflecting off the liquid, try using a diffuse source.Also, use a model, then you can concentrate on the photography.And see a doctor.', '2002-10-15 07:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
