(139835, 6978, 3859, '<td valign="top">I like very much how you managed to portray this tastefully.  Very well done!  I like the use of B&amp;W here.<br/><br/>After going thru all the photos I am changing this from 8 to 9.  The expression on her face speaks for itself.</td>', 'I like very much how you managed to portray this tastefully.  Very well done!  I like the use of B&W here.After going thru all the photos I am changing this from 8 to 9.  The expression on her face speaks for itself.', '2002-10-14 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139836, 6978, 3084, '<td valign="top">My pick of the week.  I wonder what it would have looked like in colour?  Yes, it works very well in black and white, which adds an element of drama to the image.  Great composition and work with the models.  10 Morgan</td>', 'My pick of the week.  I wonder what it would have looked like in colour?  Yes, it works very well in black and white, which adds an element of drama to the image.  Great composition and work with the models.  10 Morgan', '2002-10-14 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(139837, 6978, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge - met<br/>technical - good tonal range, b&amp;w works here<br/>composition - two things strike me ... the fact that the girl is looking straight at the camera and not at her seducer, and her left harm with the hand spread like that looks a little tense and awkward.  i would also prefer to se the blanket covering the whole visible ground, the grass is just a little distraction for me.  other than that, i like the positioning of the two of them in the grame, and the way he is looking down on her.  well done.<br/>7 -- gr8photos</td>', 'challenge - mettechnical - good tonal range, b&w works herecomposition - two things strike me ... the fact that the girl is looking straight at the camera and not at her seducer, and her left harm with the hand spread like that looks a little tense and awkward.  i would also prefer to se the blanket covering the whole visible ground, the grass is just a little distraction for me.  other than that, i like the positioning of the two of them in the grame, and the way he is looking down on her.  well done.7 -- gr8photos', '2002-10-14 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
