(139935, 6981, 3080, '<td valign="top">That looks absolutely uncomfortable.  Exclent relevance to the challenge topic.  I think that the red shirt compliments the green features very nicely.  I like the little bit of hair that is in the shot.  Your angle and framing is excelent.  The background works very nicely and focus and clarity are great.  You did an excelent job with the lighting and making it so the green wasn''t rediculously reflective.  Very nice shot. 9 Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'That looks absolutely uncomfortable.  Exclent relevance to the challenge topic.  I think that the red shirt compliments the green features very nicely.  I like the little bit of hair that is in the shot.  Your angle and framing is excelent.  The background works very nicely and focus and clarity are great.  You did an excelent job with the lighting and making it so the green wasn''t rediculously reflective.  Very nice shot. 9 Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-15 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
