(139938, 6981, 2586, '<td valign="top">Very cool image. Great composition and crop. The green face is great and well done. Good facial expression and good pose.  Nice touch: the blond hair over the face. Not so nice: the stray hair in the right of the image (distracting). The dress is not appropriate for the image; would have been better (more dramatic) if the model were nude or wore something close-fitting in black without any decorations. 8 Journey</td>', 'Very cool image. Great composition and crop. The green face is great and well done. Good facial expression and good pose.  Nice touch: the blond hair over the face. Not so nice: the stray hair in the right of the image (distracting). The dress is not appropriate for the image; would have been better (more dramatic) if the model were nude or wore something close-fitting in black without any decorations. 8 Journey', '2002-10-16 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
