(139960, 6981, 3942, '<td valign="top">WOW, top 10 for this shot? I never thought, that this pic could score so high, because green is  neither a usual nor a very nice colour for such a beautiful face. I think, that most of you voted so high because of her expression and her gorgeous eyes. I love them too!<br/><br/>As most of you I dislike the shine and the imperfections in the paint too. But the paint we used was such a wet kind of finger paint. My girlfriend was worry about getting the green out of her face after shooting and so I could not wait until it dried waterless on her face. And she was right... It did take her about 5 showers, but a little rest of green left until the next working day - Oops :-). Now I have to massage her feet every evening until the end of my life to make this forgotten. But for the 7th place it is worthwhile ;-)</td>', 'WOW, top 10 for this shot? I never thought, that this pic could score so high, because green is  neither a usual nor a very nice colour for such a beautiful face. I think, that most of you voted so high because of her expression and her gorgeous eyes. I love them too!As most of you I dislike the shine and the imperfections in the paint too. But the paint we used was such a wet kind of finger paint. My girlfriend was worry about getting the green out of her face after shooting and so I could not wait until it dried waterless on her face. And she was right... It did take her about 5 showers, but a little rest of green left until the next working day - Oops :-). Now I have to massage her feet every evening until the end of my life to make this forgotten. But for the 7th place it is worthwhile ;-)', '2002-10-21 07:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
