(139989, 6982, 3946, '<td valign="top">I scored you high just because I know that you are getting a lot of negative comments.  I mean, come on, you met the challenge (I''m debating between sloth and gluttony in your''s...prob a combination of both) and it is in focus.  The sock mark is a special touch.  The lighting could probably be better so it''s not a perfect 10 and I wouldn''t want to buy this photo and hang it up in my home.  Therefore 8 is my score.  ...and for an added note, my guy is sexier, has a better cover for the private area and is posed better :-)  However, your''s is chubbier...LOL</td>', 'I scored you high just because I know that you are getting a lot of negative comments.  I mean, come on, you met the challenge (I''m debating between sloth and gluttony in your''s...prob a combination of both) and it is in focus.  The sock mark is a special touch.  The lighting could probably be better so it''s not a perfect 10 and I wouldn''t want to buy this photo and hang it up in my home.  Therefore 8 is my score.  ...and for an added note, my guy is sexier, has a better cover for the private area and is posed better :-)  However, your''s is chubbier...LOL', '2002-10-17 05:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
