(140005, 6982, 2361, '<td valign="top">This is one where personal taste overtook voters'' appreciation of a great photograph.  It is a shame it placed so low, and its placing says a lot more about the voters than it does the image.</td>', 'This is one where personal taste overtook voters'' appreciation of a great photograph.  It is a shame it placed so low, and its placing says a lot more about the voters than it does the image.', '2002-10-22 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(140006, 6982, 4266, '<td valign="top">With all due respect to The Colonel, I think this picture is a rockin'' example of both gluttony and sloth.  If I had been around to vote, it certainly would''ve bee on of my favorites, both because of how you met the challenge and because of how well composed I think it is (someone mentioned not being set up by the title, and I think that was cool, too). <br/><br/>I find it amusing that people will say that a pic is supposed to be judged on technical merit and how well it fits the challenge and yet turn right around and judge a photo based on something so foolish as the title or the fact that they find the subject matter unappealing.<br/><br/>Good job,  Gekker.</td>', 'With all due respect to The Colonel, I think this picture is a rockin'' example of both gluttony and sloth.  If I had been around to vote, it certainly would''ve bee on of my favorites, both because of how you met the challenge and because of how well composed I think it is (someone mentioned not being set up by the title, and I think that was cool, too). I find it amusing that people will say that a pic is supposed to be judged on technical merit and how well it fits the challenge and yet turn right around and judge a photo based on something so foolish as the title or the fact that they find the subject matter unappealing.Good job,  Gekker.', '2002-10-30 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
