(140195, 6999, 3080, '<td valign="top">OK, I looked this up and it says that this is a hotel/casino.  I asume then that you meant greed.  If I hadn''t have looked this up, I would not have known this at all.  The portrayal of this is not strong as you are going on the assumption that everyone will know what this building is.  However, to people that know, the relation is strong.  My only real complaint is that there is not enough light on the statue in the front to get any detail out of it what so ever.  Other than that, this is an excelent shot!  I really like the lighting and the fountain is very pretty.  The building is well lit and the sky is also very nice.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'OK, I looked this up and it says that this is a hotel/casino.  I asume then that you meant greed.  If I hadn''t have looked this up, I would not have known this at all.  The portrayal of this is not strong as you are going on the assumption that everyone will know what this building is.  However, to people that know, the relation is strong.  My only real complaint is that there is not enough light on the statue in the front to get any detail out of it what so ever.  Other than that, this is an excelent shot!  I really like the lighting and the fountain is very pretty.  The building is well lit and the sky is also very nice.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-20 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
