(140305, 7005, 1856, '<td valign="top">Nice hubris (yes, i mean hubris :P) and composition :)  I like the lighting but wonder if it couldn''t be tweaked a little to smooth out the skin...maybe a little oil..just enough to reflect...not enough to look like greasy chicken.  The form speaks for itself without the distracting textures.  Is that horizontal shadow across the top from a barbell?  8 Lisa  (de-crypticated)</td>', 'Nice hubris (yes, i mean hubris :P) and composition :)  I like the lighting but wonder if it couldn''t be tweaked a little to smooth out the skin...maybe a little oil..just enough to reflect...not enough to look like greasy chicken.  The form speaks for itself without the distracting textures.  Is that horizontal shadow across the top from a barbell?  8 Lisa  (de-crypticated)', '2002-10-14 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
