(140315, 7005, 255, '<td valign="top">this is really nice work. i love the comp. and framing and the lighting really sets off the mood and makes for some really nice shadows. i have been going back and forth on the background but have finally decided that i dig it--the texture compliments the smoothness of the the skin very well! 9--alecia</td>', 'this is really nice work. i love the comp. and framing and the lighting really sets off the mood and makes for some really nice shadows. i have been going back and forth on the background but have finally decided that i dig it--the texture compliments the smoothness of the the skin very well! 9--alecia', '2002-10-16 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(140316, 7005, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent job with the lighting... the shadows cast in this image do a great job of highlighting the form... - setzler</td>', 'excellent job with the lighting... the shadows cast in this image do a great job of highlighting the form... - setzler', '2002-10-16 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
