(140521, 7017, 3459, '<td valign="top">Very beautifully executed!</td>', 'Very beautifully executed!', '2002-10-17 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(140522, 7017, 3313, '<td valign="top">As a French speaker, I''m not familiar with Salinger''s work. I''ll have to correct that ASAP. Great shot and I''m sorry (for me mainly) that the allusions escape me. But think of that: when I get to read the book, your picture will be in my mind somewhere :-) marcvg. Oh, forgot to say anything about the photo. I think the composition is great. I like the monotone effect. The only thing I don''t like so much is the wall texture which sort of intrudes. Good luck with the challenge. 8</td>', 'As a French speaker, I''m not familiar with Salinger''s work. I''ll have to correct that ASAP. Great shot and I''m sorry (for me mainly) that the allusions escape me. But think of that: when I get to read the book, your picture will be in my mind somewhere :-) marcvg. Oh, forgot to say anything about the photo. I think the composition is great. I like the monotone effect. The only thing I don''t like so much is the wall texture which sort of intrudes. Good luck with the challenge. 8', '2002-10-17 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
