(140566, 7019, 1041, '<td valign="top">first impression -- this could be vanity as well as greed.  rings on ringfinger look too tight, almost painful.  maybe that was your intention?<br/>challenge -- met<br/>technical -- good.  some hotspots from reflections but i doubt that was avoidable, and they are not too distracting.<br/>composition -- the ring on the lower hand (with the face) is kind of destracting here.  i think this would''ve worked better with just one hand, or no rings on the lower hand.<br/>overall -- 6 from gr8photos</td>', 'first impression -- this could be vanity as well as greed.  rings on ringfinger look too tight, almost painful.  maybe that was your intention?challenge -- mettechnical -- good.  some hotspots from reflections but i doubt that was avoidable, and they are not too distracting.composition -- the ring on the lower hand (with the face) is kind of destracting here.  i think this would''ve worked better with just one hand, or no rings on the lower hand.overall -- 6 from gr8photos', '2002-10-18 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
