(140737, 7028, 917, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but youve chopped the tail. Also, try using the rule of thirds to eliminate the cluttered background and show the bark texture.<br/><br/>If the squrrels often use this route up the tree, and its in your back garden, try clipping some of the hedge back to make for a cleaner shot next time.</td>', 'Nice image, but youve chopped the tail. Also, try using the rule of thirds to eliminate the cluttered background and show the bark texture.If the squrrels often use this route up the tree, and its in your back garden, try clipping some of the hedge back to make for a cleaner shot next time.', '2002-10-14 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(140738, 7028, 2490, '<td valign="top">The only envy is in the title.  While it''s cute, I don''t think you''ve really met the challenge.  That said, I love animal photos.  5 nards656</td>', 'The only envy is in the title.  While it''s cute, I don''t think you''ve really met the challenge.  That said, I love animal photos.  5 nards656', '2002-10-14 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(140739, 7028, 811, '<td valign="top">Great outdoors shot.  The focus and composition work well.  Challenge?  Well, I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt -- but without your title, I would''ve been lost.  karmat</td>', 'Great outdoors shot.  The focus and composition work well.  Challenge?  Well, I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt -- but without your title, I would''ve been lost.  karmat', '2002-10-14 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
