(140919, 7039, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a little on the edge for this site, not that I''m all against it.  Is that a man''s hand touching it?  That''s more ironic than anything.  The photo is well taken.  The composition here is making wonder a little though.  The man''s hand is kind of grainy, but the "thing" seems pretty darn focused and smooth.  I wonder if that''s a function of color and reflectivity more than anything.  Good shot.</td>', 'This is a little on the edge for this site, not that I''m all against it.  Is that a man''s hand touching it?  That''s more ironic than anything.  The photo is well taken.  The composition here is making wonder a little though.  The man''s hand is kind of grainy, but the "thing" seems pretty darn focused and smooth.  I wonder if that''s a function of color and reflectivity more than anything.  Good shot.', '2002-10-14 06:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
