(140991, 7041, 3932, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot... is it throwing up, or chowing down? :)  I like the intersecting lines in the shot.  But feel that you would have a more visually appealing shot if the shot had been placed a bit differently, maybe to where the line going up to the top-right corner would lead out of the frame instead of the over-exposed wall.  -  JB</td>', 'Interesting shot... is it throwing up, or chowing down? :)  I like the intersecting lines in the shot.  But feel that you would have a more visually appealing shot if the shot had been placed a bit differently, maybe to where the line going up to the top-right corner would lead out of the frame instead of the over-exposed wall.  -  JB', '2002-10-14 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
