(141147, 7051, 51167, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many people are going to say that this doesn''t have anything to do with the theme.  It is a great idea and a great shot.  I''m giving you a 9.  There are little artifacts around the edges and without those you''d have a 10 from me.  Do a little less compression to make the picture as close to 150 K.  This one the size is 25 K I believe.  So a bigger file picture will greatly improve your quality.  Good Job! 9 -Jubei</td>', 'I wonder how many people are going to say that this doesn''t have anything to do with the theme.  It is a great idea and a great shot.  I''m giving you a 9.  There are little artifacts around the edges and without those you''d have a 10 from me.  Do a little less compression to make the picture as close to 150 K.  This one the size is 25 K I believe.  So a bigger file picture will greatly improve your quality.  Good Job! 9 -Jubei', '2002-10-15 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
