(141203, 7056, 4293, '<td valign="top">I dig the collection but I  don''t think it''s a very interesting photo...I think a toy collection would be more interesting if it had a childlike organization to it.  For instance, I really don''t like the way all the handles on the shovels are so straight and the blocks could be a little more jumbled up, etc.  Just an opinion...</td>', 'I dig the collection but I  don''t think it''s a very interesting photo...I think a toy collection would be more interesting if it had a childlike organization to it.  For instance, I really don''t like the way all the handles on the shovels are so straight and the blocks could be a little more jumbled up, etc.  Just an opinion...', '2002-10-14 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141204, 7056, 1255, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I would have no idea how this relates to the 7 deadly sins.  Still, even with the title, I''m hard pressed to think of envy.  The photo seems too bright/overexposed and the posed look of the toys and harsh white background do little for it.  Perhaps a more subdued background wih fewer toys; also maybe closer to them so that their antiquity was more apparent. shedonist</td>', 'Without the title, I would have no idea how this relates to the 7 deadly sins.  Still, even with the title, I''m hard pressed to think of envy.  The photo seems too bright/overexposed and the posed look of the toys and harsh white background do little for it.  Perhaps a more subdued background wih fewer toys; also maybe closer to them so that their antiquity was more apparent. shedonist', '2002-10-14 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
