(141210, 7056, 4007, '<td valign="top">It''s just a shelf of toys in my eyes.  It means a lot to you and probably other toy collectors out there, but this subject is completely dull to me (and probably most others), and you''ve done nothing creative with it to make it interesting to me or somehow show it''s greater value.  It needs some more visual appeal or some deeper meaning to it.  2 wingy</td>', 'It''s just a shelf of toys in my eyes.  It means a lot to you and probably other toy collectors out there, but this subject is completely dull to me (and probably most others), and you''ve done nothing creative with it to make it interesting to me or somehow show it''s greater value.  It needs some more visual appeal or some deeper meaning to it.  2 wingy', '2002-10-15 03:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
