(141213, 7056, 436, '<td valign="top">In fact, any toy collector would be PROUD to own this. He or she might ENVY your ownership! (But then I earn my living as an editor not a photographer).  It''s an impressive collection!  I certainly envy the Longaberger basket on the table!!  But the composition strikes me as more of a recording (maybe for insurance purposes) than as an artistic well composed phot.  How very triking a still life of just the tops would be!  Macro  might especially bring out the detail.  I encourage you the use the wealth of beauty shown in this photo in a more striking composition.  The raw material is certainly here!</td>', 'In fact, any toy collector would be PROUD to own this. He or she might ENVY your ownership! (But then I earn my living as an editor not a photographer).  It''s an impressive collection!  I certainly envy the Longaberger basket on the table!!  But the composition strikes me as more of a recording (maybe for insurance purposes) than as an artistic well composed phot.  How very triking a still life of just the tops would be!  Macro  might especially bring out the detail.  I encourage you the use the wealth of beauty shown in this photo in a more striking composition.  The raw material is certainly here!', '2002-10-17 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
