(141319, 7061, 1041, '<td valign="top">initial reaction -- how do i know it''s selfish and beyond reason from looking at the photo?  but then, it''s not a title competition ...<br/>challenge -- met<br/>technical -- i''m sure it was intentional, but the photo is too blue and dark for my liking.  some of the highlights (next to the face, the 50) are too strong.<br/>composition -- like how the hands are in the corner and most of the photo is jumbled up money.  like that you added coins and didn''t just use notes.<br/>overall -- 5 from gr8photos</td>', 'initial reaction -- how do i know it''s selfish and beyond reason from looking at the photo?  but then, it''s not a title competition ...challenge -- mettechnical -- i''m sure it was intentional, but the photo is too blue and dark for my liking.  some of the highlights (next to the face, the 50) are too strong.composition -- like how the hands are in the corner and most of the photo is jumbled up money.  like that you added coins and didn''t just use notes.overall -- 5 from gr8photos', '2002-10-16 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141320, 7061, 4648, '<td valign="top">Different...Would have liked it a little lighter blue.</td>', 'Different...Would have liked it a little lighter blue.', '2002-10-16 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
