(141412, 7067, 3080, '<td valign="top">Greed is the desire for material wealth or gain, ignoring the realm of the spiritual.<br/>I think that with the combination of the photo with the title, this is an excelent representation of greed.  I''m giving this a 6.  I will say though that without the title, this photo does not stand on it''s own to meet the challenge.  To me (without the title) it represents throwing your money away, which is just the oposite of greed.<br/>I think that the title is important, but should not speak FOR the photo.<br/>However, this is a well thought out, well executed photo and is technically good.  The light glare around the toilet seat is a bit annoying, but it''s not a huge deal.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Greed is the desire for material wealth or gain, ignoring the realm of the spiritual.I think that with the combination of the photo with the title, this is an excelent representation of greed.  I''m giving this a 6.  I will say though that without the title, this photo does not stand on it''s own to meet the challenge.  To me (without the title) it represents throwing your money away, which is just the oposite of greed.I think that the title is important, but should not speak FOR the photo.However, this is a well thought out, well executed photo and is technically good.  The light glare around the toilet seat is a bit annoying, but it''s not a huge deal.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-15 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141413, 7067, 2490, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Good question.  I could leave a buck pretty easy, but a hundred???  The pic isn''t very impressive, though.  Glare on the seat, no rule of thirds.  5 nards656</td>', 'Ha!  Good question.  I could leave a buck pretty easy, but a hundred???  The pic isn''t very impressive, though.  Glare on the seat, no rule of thirds.  5 nards656', '2002-10-15 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
