(141429, 7068, 2923, '<td valign="top">-10 for the teddy bear! :) just kidding, the teddy bear adds to the image instead of just being cute.  Pure sadness on the model, photo is not technically perfect but the feeling is there.  Have you tried B&amp;W or Sepia?  might be some interesting effect there i think.   Captured very well, i can feel her pain (wraith, envy, whatever, doesn''t matter).  I like if not for the technical resasons (slightly blurred).  9 paganini (that''s my first teddy bear 9 by the way, would''ve work wonders for me as a childhood submission as well)</td>', '-10 for the teddy bear! :) just kidding, the teddy bear adds to the image instead of just being cute.  Pure sadness on the model, photo is not technically perfect but the feeling is there.  Have you tried B&W or Sepia?  might be some interesting effect there i think.   Captured very well, i can feel her pain (wraith, envy, whatever, doesn''t matter).  I like if not for the technical resasons (slightly blurred).  9 paganini (that''s my first teddy bear 9 by the way, would''ve work wonders for me as a childhood submission as well)', '2002-10-14 02:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
