(141449, 7068, 2337, '<td valign="top">Powerful.  The kind of shot that can move people and hopefully make a differance in a life.  The one small nitpick I have is the lower right corner... That dark patch kept pulling me away from the subject and lessened the impact (at least for me)   ~ MyQyl ~</td>', 'Powerful.  The kind of shot that can move people and hopefully make a differance in a life.  The one small nitpick I have is the lower right corner... That dark patch kept pulling me away from the subject and lessened the impact (at least for me)   ~ MyQyl ~', '2002-10-15 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
