(141469, 7068, 3273, '<td valign="top">This photo is really quite disturbing (which is good for the challenge).  It conveys real emotion.<br/><br/>The contrast seems to be slightly wrong on the girls face but IMO this only adds to the feeling of the photo.  The uneven lighting on the background wall only add to the focus on the girl.  9/10</td>', 'This photo is really quite disturbing (which is good for the challenge).  It conveys real emotion.The contrast seems to be slightly wrong on the girls face but IMO this only adds to the feeling of the photo.  The uneven lighting on the background wall only add to the focus on the girl.  9/10', '2002-10-18 03:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141470, 7068, 2798, '<td valign="top">Captures the feeling of the moment wonderfully. Excellent work and a well deserved 10. - floyd</td>', 'Captures the feeling of the moment wonderfully. Excellent work and a well deserved 10. - floyd', '2002-10-20 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141471, 7068, 4698, '<td valign="top">A haunting image, beautifully (if that''s the right word!) conveying the emotion of the situation. I hope you do well in the overall results!</td>', 'A haunting image, beautifully (if that''s the right word!) conveying the emotion of the situation. I hope you do well in the overall results!', '2002-10-20 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141472, 7068, 4624, '<td valign="top">Very realistic looking!</td>', 'Very realistic looking!', '2002-10-20 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141473, 7068, 1037, '<td valign="top">Heather, I gave this a 10 during the week, but knowing that it was by you makes it so much more meaningful. It''s a very powerful photo. Great work.</td>', 'Heather, I gave this a 10 during the week, but knowing that it was by you makes it so much more meaningful. It''s a very powerful photo. Great work.', '2002-10-22 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(141474, 7070, 4005, '<td valign="top">Its a really nice shot, but I think, it would look better, without the chains. The lighting is good, seems a bit blurry, but intentionally?!? 7 - KAOS</td>', 'Its a really nice shot, but I think, it would look better, without the chains. The lighting is good, seems a bit blurry, but intentionally?!? 7 - KAOS', '2002-10-14 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141475, 7070, 4402, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject matter but the focusing is strange.</td>', 'Very interesting subject matter but the focusing is strange.', '2002-10-14 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141476, 7070, 4564, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W would have been more suited for this shot to eliminated the orange color that reminds me too much of how video reacts (and sometimes digital cams) under lowlight conditions.  It would have made the statue look a lot better.  Above average. 6/10</td>', 'B&W would have been more suited for this shot to eliminated the orange color that reminds me too much of how video reacts (and sometimes digital cams) under lowlight conditions.  It would have made the statue look a lot better.  Above average. 6/10', '2002-10-14 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
