(141480, 7070, 3464, '<td valign="top">Good idea, snake not too clearly a snake but I like the contrast between the statue''s tone and color and the shine of the ''snake''</td>', 'Good idea, snake not too clearly a snake but I like the contrast between the statue''s tone and color and the shine of the ''snake''', '2002-10-14 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
