(141488, 7070, 1037, '<td valign="top">I thought this was very beautifully lit and composed. I gave it a 10.</td>', 'I thought this was very beautifully lit and composed. I gave it a 10.', '2002-10-22 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(141489, 7070, 2693, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much to everyone commenting. It means a lot to get this feed back and I am most grateful to you for taking the time.</td>', 'Thank you very much to everyone commenting. It means a lot to get this feed back and I am most grateful to you for taking the time.', '2002-10-27 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(141490, 7071, 327, '<td valign="top">Love your lighting, and composition. Not crazy for the crop at the bottom...I know size limits. This is good, I admire your creativity, it''s a good shot. Justine</td>', 'Love your lighting, and composition. Not crazy for the crop at the bottom...I know size limits. This is good, I admire your creativity, it''s a good shot. Justine', '2002-10-14 05:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141491, 7071, 3901, '<td valign="top">The color cast detracts a lot from the shot.</td>', 'The color cast detracts a lot from the shot.', '2002-10-14 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141492, 7071, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Very clear message.  Focus on the watch is perfect as is the lack of focus on the knife.  There is enough clarity throughout the photo to get the point, yet still a "in the background" kind of way.  Lighting is nice.  Was there a reason for the long exposure with the second hand?  Something relevant to that specific time that I am missing?  It doesn''t really matter, doesn''t affect my score or anything, just curious.  Very nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Very nice. Very clear message.  Focus on the watch is perfect as is the lack of focus on the knife.  There is enough clarity throughout the photo to get the point, yet still a "in the background" kind of way.  Lighting is nice.  Was there a reason for the long exposure with the second hand?  Something relevant to that specific time that I am missing?  It doesn''t really matter, doesn''t affect my score or anything, just curious.  Very nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-14 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141493, 7071, 4564, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors. Interesting use of the closeup. Framing is ok but I feel it is missing something. 7/10</td>', 'Interesting colors. Interesting use of the closeup. Framing is ok but I feel it is missing something. 7/10', '2002-10-14 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141494, 7071, 3380, '<td valign="top">Wonderful creativity and framing. Good use of you DOF.</td>', 'Wonderful creativity and framing. Good use of you DOF.', '2002-10-14 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141495, 7071, 3464, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and I like the clarity of the watch</td>', 'Interesting idea and I like the clarity of the watch', '2002-10-14 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141496, 7071, 3932, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think the gradient color across the background works quite well.  The limited dof seems to work well in this shot.  I would like to see what it would look like with a deep dof though, just for kicks :)   Good job!   -   JB</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think the gradient color across the background works quite well.  The limited dof seems to work well in this shot.  I would like to see what it would look like with a deep dof though, just for kicks :)   Good job!   -   JB', '2002-10-14 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
