(141501, 7071, 2490, '<td valign="top">Excellent quality on the watch, except for a slight glare that PS possibly could have eliminated.  Great color, obvious slow exposure (based on the second hand).  If it weren''t for your title, though, I wouldn''t connect it to the challenge very well.  8 nards656</td>', 'Excellent quality on the watch, except for a slight glare that PS possibly could have eliminated.  Great color, obvious slow exposure (based on the second hand).  If it weren''t for your title, though, I wouldn''t connect it to the challenge very well.  8 nards656', '2002-10-15 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141502, 7071, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very neat, clarity is magnificent.  I''ve been trying to think if the time 3:02 mean''t anything, but I''m not coming up with anything.  It''s been a long time since I''ve read the book, "A Time To Kill", so I can''t remember if there is a significance.  The only thing about this shot is that it just seems TOO clean and neat.  Killing is messy especially with a knife...maybe there should be more blood, but that''s beside the point.  Congrads on a nice shot.</td>', 'Very neat, clarity is magnificent.  I''ve been trying to think if the time 3:02 mean''t anything, but I''m not coming up with anything.  It''s been a long time since I''ve read the book, "A Time To Kill", so I can''t remember if there is a significance.  The only thing about this shot is that it just seems TOO clean and neat.  Killing is messy especially with a knife...maybe there should be more blood, but that''s beside the point.  Congrads on a nice shot.', '2002-10-16 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141503, 7071, 4580, '<td valign="top">Like the color on this and the soft background for a harsh subject</td>', 'Like the color on this and the soft background for a harsh subject', '2002-10-16 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
