(141528, 7072, 255, '<td valign="top">one of the most beautifully lit photos I have ever seen here! it almost looks peaceful until you look closer and see what you are packing! ;)<br/>the composition and angle work well also. 10--alecia</td>', 'one of the most beautifully lit photos I have ever seen here! it almost looks peaceful until you look closer and see what you are packing! ;)the composition and angle work well also. 10--alecia', '2002-10-16 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
