(141530, 7072, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow! freaky picture.  At first I thought he had a remote in his hand.   He looks wicked.  Good colors and lighting.<br/>Vote 10 <br/>Sonifo</td>', 'Wow! freaky picture.  At first I thought he had a remote in his hand.   He looks wicked.  Good colors and lighting.Vote 10 Sonifo', '2002-10-17 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141531, 7072, 1005, '<td valign="top">Huge legs...oh yes, that''s the angle of the camera, prolly not good.  Makes him look like he has large legs and a small head.  Then again, he has a gun in his hands and latex gloves (hard to see!), looks like he''s waiting to do something really bad, so he probably does have a small head!  7 Swash</td>', 'Huge legs...oh yes, that''s the angle of the camera, prolly not good.  Makes him look like he has large legs and a small head.  Then again, he has a gun in his hands and latex gloves (hard to see!), looks like he''s waiting to do something really bad, so he probably does have a small head!  7 Swash', '2002-10-18 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141532, 7072, 4648, '<td valign="top">A total turn off becaue of colorization and darkness.</td>', 'A total turn off becaue of colorization and darkness.', '2002-10-20 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141533, 7072, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love this house.  Wonderful colors.  The angle and framing/cropping of this shot are nice.  I see both wrath and sloth in this shot.  Perfect lighting.  Your focus is also very nice.  Great portrayal of the challenge. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I love this house.  Wonderful colors.  The angle and framing/cropping of this shot are nice.  I see both wrath and sloth in this shot.  Perfect lighting.  Your focus is also very nice.  Great portrayal of the challenge. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-20 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141534, 7072, 368, '<td valign="top">love the colors and angle .... makes it pretty eerie to me ... 7-photosbyayme</td>', 'love the colors and angle .... makes it pretty eerie to me ... 7-photosbyayme', '2002-10-20 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
