(141653, 7080, 3464, '<td valign="top">I think that the fist alone would have been effective although the gritted teeth leave no doubt as to the ''violence'' A little scary</td>', 'I think that the fist alone would have been effective although the gritted teeth leave no doubt as to the ''violence'' A little scary', '2002-10-14 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141654, 7080, 4388, '<td valign="top">alomost scary, very good photo.  just a little too bright at the bottom right corner.</td>', 'alomost scary, very good photo.  just a little too bright at the bottom right corner.', '2002-10-14 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141655, 7080, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image...a married angry man with a fist dipicting domestic abuse.  Great title for your photo.  It is emotionally charging and disturbing.</td>', 'Very powerful image...a married angry man with a fist dipicting domestic abuse.  Great title for your photo.  It is emotionally charging and disturbing.', '2002-10-14 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141656, 7080, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wrath is manifested in the individual who spurns love and opts instead for fury.  Wrath is represented by the bear and the color red.<br/>I think this is a great portrayal of wrath.  About as wrathful as it gets. I love the use of black and white here.  I think that the angle and framing/cropping are great, and your focus is also very nice.  Excelent shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Wrath is manifested in the individual who spurns love and opts instead for fury.  Wrath is represented by the bear and the color red.I think this is a great portrayal of wrath.  About as wrathful as it gets. I love the use of black and white here.  I think that the angle and framing/cropping are great, and your focus is also very nice.  Excelent shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-15 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141657, 7080, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like it.  8</td>', 'I like it.  8', '2002-10-15 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141658, 7080, 4596, '<td valign="top">One of the few in this challenge that is actually on topic, and a welcome relief to all those stupid pet shots. Good composition on this photo and a good use of lights and darks. This photo does not look as faked as the one stealing a wallet and shows artistry. Good choice of cropping on the face as it divides at midpoint of the mouth. Further over, one way or the other would have ruined the shot. There is a good weighting between the size of the fist and the size of the face. Again, a great way to draw attention to the object of focus the fist. Probably would have been better if the subject hadn''t been wearing a white shirt as that proves problematic here.</td>', 'One of the few in this challenge that is actually on topic, and a welcome relief to all those stupid pet shots. Good composition on this photo and a good use of lights and darks. This photo does not look as faked as the one stealing a wallet and shows artistry. Good choice of cropping on the face as it divides at midpoint of the mouth. Further over, one way or the other would have ruined the shot. There is a good weighting between the size of the fist and the size of the face. Again, a great way to draw attention to the object of focus the fist. Probably would have been better if the subject hadn''t been wearing a white shirt as that proves problematic here.', '2002-10-16 09:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141659, 7080, 47, '<td valign="top">there are hotlines for that, ma''am</td>', 'there are hotlines for that, ma''am', '2002-10-17 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141660, 7080, 3672, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background 6 , Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing 9, Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6 , Total Averaged Rating 7 .  smshats</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background 6 , Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing 9, Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6 , Total Averaged Rating 7 .  smshats', '2002-10-17 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141661, 7080, 1856, '<td valign="top">Great capture of wrath..good contrasts for b&amp;w.  The framing makes it seem as though the photo was taken in the heat of the moment...catching just a part of what was about to happen...nice!  7 Lisa</td>', 'Great capture of wrath..good contrasts for b&w.  The framing makes it seem as though the photo was taken in the heat of the moment...catching just a part of what was about to happen...nice!  7 Lisa', '2002-10-18 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141662, 7080, 656, '<td valign="top">interesting idea.  The shot is very over exposed though - especially the t-shirt.<br/><br/>Not sure how you converted to B&amp;W but the contrast is a bit ''flat'' in tone.  The<br/>face seems a bit out of focus. <br/><br/>Other than some of these technical things, I think this is a pretty good, creative attempt to show ''Wrath''</td>', 'interesting idea.  The shot is very over exposed though - especially the t-shirt.Not sure how you converted to B&W but the contrast is a bit ''flat'' in tone.  Theface seems a bit out of focus. Other than some of these technical things, I think this is a pretty good, creative attempt to show ''Wrath''', '2002-10-18 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141663, 7080, 4648, '<td valign="top">Should have focused on the fist and left the face out.  Face acutally looks fake and detracts from what you are saying.  Good shot of hand.  Hand looks almot alive.</td>', 'Should have focused on the fist and left the face out.  Face acutally looks fake and detracts from what you are saying.  Good shot of hand.  Hand looks almot alive.', '2002-10-20 02:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141664, 7081, 327, '<td valign="top">Kooool. Fun shot, watch your blood pressure. Good luck.</td>', 'Kooool. Fun shot, watch your blood pressure. Good luck.', '2002-10-14 05:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141665, 7081, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice motion blur that shows speed and also has lots of detail on the hand. The blur also makes it seem like the person was acting rashly and confused. Nice red hue as well :)<br/>9 - Konador</td>', 'Really nice motion blur that shows speed and also has lots of detail on the hand. The blur also makes it seem like the person was acting rashly and confused. Nice red hue as well :)9 - Konador', '2002-10-14 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141666, 7081, 4564, '<td valign="top">I love the movement. Great color.  Nice contrasts.  Very well executed. 8/10</td>', 'I love the movement. Great color.  Nice contrasts.  Very well executed. 8/10', '2002-10-14 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141667, 7081, 2989, '<td valign="top">I see the blurryness helps show movement, but its a little too blury.</td>', 'I see the blurryness helps show movement, but its a little too blury.', '2002-10-14 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
