(141680, 7081, 255, '<td valign="top">this is great! you have really managed to isolate anger in this shot. the long exposure works well in portraying this. you are left wondering who the victim/target is and even cringing a little yourself! 9--alecia</td>', 'this is great! you have really managed to isolate anger in this shot. the long exposure works well in portraying this. you are left wondering who the victim/target is and even cringing a little yourself! 9--alecia', '2002-10-16 19:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
