(141682, 7081, 3087, '<td valign="top">Is it a bird, is it a plane, is it superman? No it''s a fist of fury! :)<br/>Nice idea - feels toooo blurry for me and the whiteout on the hand is too strong for my taste.<br/>Cool idea though!<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Is it a bird, is it a plane, is it superman? No it''s a fist of fury! :)Nice idea - feels toooo blurry for me and the whiteout on the hand is too strong for my taste.Cool idea though!5, Kavey', '2002-10-17 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
