(141684, 7081, 2563, '<td valign="top">...and flame of anger, right? nice...commet</td>', '...and flame of anger, right? nice...commet', '2002-10-17 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141685, 7081, 1543, '<td valign="top">nice blur</td>', 'nice blur', '2002-10-17 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141686, 7081, 811, '<td valign="top">Good use of motion, I think.  I assume you took the picture while the hand was thrusting forward and then stopped.  Sometimes, it works better to place your hand (or other moving object) in the final position, hold it for a few seconds, then move backwards.  That way, the "end" position is really clear, but you still have the motion blur! karmat</td>', 'Good use of motion, I think.  I assume you took the picture while the hand was thrusting forward and then stopped.  Sometimes, it works better to place your hand (or other moving object) in the final position, hold it for a few seconds, then move backwards.  That way, the "end" position is really clear, but you still have the motion blur! karmat', '2002-10-18 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141687, 7081, 2716, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Nice shot. 7</td>', 'Interesting.  Nice shot. 7', '2002-10-19 07:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
