(141689, 7081, 441, '<td valign="top">good action shot</td>', 'good action shot', '2002-10-19 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141690, 7081, 3080, '<td valign="top">Representswrath in more ways than one.  I really like the motion here.  The redness increases the wrathness.  The motion shows that something is happening here.  I like the lighting, although I wouldn''t want the thumb area any brighter.  Angle and framing/cropping are good.  nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Representswrath in more ways than one.  I really like the motion here.  The redness increases the wrathness.  The motion shows that something is happening here.  I like the lighting, although I wouldn''t want the thumb area any brighter.  Angle and framing/cropping are good.  nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-20 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141691, 7082, 92, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I really like how you did this shot:) Shiiizzzam</td>', 'Nicely done. I really like how you did this shot:) Shiiizzzam', '2002-10-14 02:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
