(141715, 7084, 3080, '<td valign="top">Are there really only that many of these?  They are swarming around here.  I get the point though, and it''s nicely made.  This is one of the sexiest trucks I''ve ever seen.  Too bad for the interior paint though.  Every one I''ve seen had the paint on the doors falling off, and the door locks look all crappy.  That has nothing to do with your photo, lol, just thought I''d mention it.  nice angle and framing/cropping.  I like how you have the truck being washed and groomed.  Definately fits the challenge.  Nice job.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Are there really only that many of these?  They are swarming around here.  I get the point though, and it''s nicely made.  This is one of the sexiest trucks I''ve ever seen.  Too bad for the interior paint though.  Every one I''ve seen had the paint on the doors falling off, and the door locks look all crappy.  That has nothing to do with your photo, lol, just thought I''d mention it.  nice angle and framing/cropping.  I like how you have the truck being washed and groomed.  Definately fits the challenge.  Nice job.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-14 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
