(141735, 7085, 3942, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Important message in a very creative manner! But 2 things are disturbing the impression a little bit.The left side of the injection is a little overexposed because of the strong direct illumination. And I would have cropped a little bit different. IMHO there is too much ''empty space'' below your main subject. Using the ''rule of thirds'' could be helpful here. Nevertheless I like your shot and voted 8. -nds</td>', 'Great idea! Important message in a very creative manner! But 2 things are disturbing the impression a little bit.The left side of the injection is a little overexposed because of the strong direct illumination. And I would have cropped a little bit different. IMHO there is too much ''empty space'' below your main subject. Using the ''rule of thirds'' could be helpful here. Nevertheless I like your shot and voted 8. -nds', '2002-10-14 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
