(141921, 7095, 2923, '<td valign="top">Is this a reflection submission? :)  actually it looks more to me like Wraith.  I like it. 9</td>', 'Is this a reflection submission? :)  actually it looks more to me like Wraith.  I like it. 9', '2002-10-20 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141922, 7095, 4007, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  The shot seems slightly "over the top" so to speak, seeming almost like a horror movie poster.  While I do think it''s deeper than that, it walks that line closely.  That said, the shot is clear and easily understood.  It''s effective and evokes an emotional responce. The reflection is excellent.  I like it very much. 8 wingy</td>', 'Interesting.  The shot seems slightly "over the top" so to speak, seeming almost like a horror movie poster.  While I do think it''s deeper than that, it walks that line closely.  That said, the shot is clear and easily understood.  It''s effective and evokes an emotional responce. The reflection is excellent.  I like it very much. 8 wingy', '2002-10-21 01:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(141923, 7095, 472, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Who''s in the picture?</td>', 'I like it.  Who''s in the picture?', '2002-10-21 08:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(141924, 7095, 1066, '<td valign="top">The person in the picture is a friend of ours...she is a make-up artist at the local theatre where they are working on "Rocky Horror Picture Show".  I am shooting the stills.</td>', 'The person in the picture is a friend of ours...she is a make-up artist at the local theatre where they are working on "Rocky Horror Picture Show".  I am shooting the stills.', '2002-10-21 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(141925, 7095, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''m finally going through and commenting on my favourite photos from this week (I didn''t have time before). This was one of my 10s :). It''s just brilliant, the kind of photo that I would describe as having a narrative feel. I can create a story to explain the elements of the knife and the woman''s face. A photo that does that is very powerful.</td>', 'I''m finally going through and commenting on my favourite photos from this week (I didn''t have time before). This was one of my 10s :). It''s just brilliant, the kind of photo that I would describe as having a narrative feel. I can create a story to explain the elements of the knife and the woman''s face. A photo that does that is very powerful.', '2002-10-22 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(141926, 7095, 4648, '<td valign="top">What does the commenter mean by noise on the left side of the knife.  I''ve been taking pictures for over 40 years, am still an amaeture and don''t know what they mean by noise, even though my camera has noise reduction....PTL</td>', 'What does the commenter mean by noise on the left side of the knife.  I''ve been taking pictures for over 40 years, am still an amaeture and don''t know what they mean by noise, even though my camera has noise reduction....PTL', '2002-10-22 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(141927, 7095, 1066, '<td valign="top">I was not sure what the "noise" comment was about.<br/><br/>The serrations on the knife have multiple reflections/highlights coming off that might give the impression of noise.  the knife was not new...It has lots of use and imperfections which I liked in macro mode becasue it gave it that "I just picked this knife up off the counter after making a ham sandwich to kick your a$$ you stupid beer drinking, WWE watching, homophobic, hard hat wearing pig!"...whew..I think I have issues &amp;gt;:-D</td>', 'I was not sure what the "noise" comment was about.The serrations on the knife have multiple reflections/highlights coming off that might give the impression of noise.  the knife was not new...It has lots of use and imperfections which I liked in macro mode becasue it gave it that "I just picked this knife up off the counter after making a ham sandwich to kick your a$$ you stupid beer drinking, WWE watching, homophobic, hard hat wearing pig!"...whew..I think I have issues &gt;:-D', '2002-10-23 08:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(141928, 7096, 3732, '<td valign="top">Good job</td>', 'Good job', '2002-10-14 03:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
