(141930, 7096, 4596, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. The composition is very good. The angle of the arms is compelling. The contrast between the feminine and masculine is good. Title of the shot also lends weight here for the interpretation of sin.</td>', 'I like this shot. The composition is very good. The angle of the arms is compelling. The contrast between the feminine and masculine is good. Title of the shot also lends weight here for the interpretation of sin.', '2002-10-14 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
