(141954, 7098, 3859, '<td valign="top">Cute picture ---I see nothing sinful here!</td>', 'Cute picture ---I see nothing sinful here!', '2002-10-15 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141955, 7098, 3900, '<td valign="top">Cats'' favorite past time.  Nice.</td>', 'Cats'' favorite past time.  Nice.', '2002-10-15 07:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141956, 7098, 917, '<td valign="top">Whilst Im a bit bored of all the cat photos, this one at least is a good photo, with the tail helping with the framing of the subject, and the background being a nice rich warm sleepy colour.<br/><br/>Its not so totally stunning that it makes up for the boring subject, though, so I''ll still dock a point to make it a 7, which is alot better than the 2s and 3s Ive been giving some other cat pics.</td>', 'Whilst Im a bit bored of all the cat photos, this one at least is a good photo, with the tail helping with the framing of the subject, and the background being a nice rich warm sleepy colour.Its not so totally stunning that it makes up for the boring subject, though, so I''ll still dock a point to make it a 7, which is alot better than the 2s and 3s Ive been giving some other cat pics.', '2002-10-15 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141957, 7098, 2717, '<td valign="top">So clear, great shot  10 Frank</td>', 'So clear, great shot  10 Frank', '2002-10-15 13:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141958, 7098, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup - great focus and capture of the color.</td>', 'Nice closeup - great focus and capture of the color.', '2002-10-16 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141959, 7098, 3317, '<td valign="top">over the past 2 years i''ve taken about a zillion pictures of my roommates cats, so i speak from experience here: they''re not as compelling to everybody else as they are to you. this is darn cute though.</td>', 'over the past 2 years i''ve taken about a zillion pictures of my roommates cats, so i speak from experience here: they''re not as compelling to everybody else as they are to you. this is darn cute though.', '2002-10-17 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141960, 7098, 3294, '<td valign="top">funny picture.  Hope you didn''t wake it!  bamaster (7)</td>', 'funny picture.  Hope you didn''t wake it!  bamaster (7)', '2002-10-18 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141961, 7098, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''ve read all the comments about can animals sin but that doesn''t affect my vote at all.  Good pet picture just wish the background were a different color.  That would set the cat off.</td>', 'I''ve read all the comments about can animals sin but that doesn''t affect my vote at all.  Good pet picture just wish the background were a different color.  That would set the cat off.', '2002-10-20 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141962, 7099, 2, '<td valign="top">Great composition and excellent use of negative space.  7 -drew</td>', 'Great composition and excellent use of negative space.  7 -drew', '2002-10-14 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141963, 7099, 327, '<td valign="top">Hands in the air! Good luck.</td>', 'Hands in the air! Good luck.', '2002-10-14 05:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141964, 7099, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot... I think the negative space works very well here.  I think this particular image would have even greater impact if the tip of the gun was in sharper focus and the depth of field faded from that point... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent shot... I think the negative space works very well here.  I think this particular image would have even greater impact if the tip of the gun was in sharper focus and the depth of field faded from that point... good work :) - setzler', '2002-10-14 07:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141965, 7099, 3127, '<td valign="top">Really great shot. At first i was going to say that it was too dark, but I think the darkness helps to strengthen the subject matter. Good job!</td>', 'Really great shot. At first i was going to say that it was too dark, but I think the darkness helps to strengthen the subject matter. Good job!', '2002-10-14 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141966, 7099, 2780, '<td valign="top">This photo is great.<br/>Really nice black and white, with a strong neg space background making the gun stand out beautifully.<br/>9 - Konador</td>', 'This photo is great.Really nice black and white, with a strong neg space background making the gun stand out beautifully.9 - Konador', '2002-10-14 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141967, 7099, 3859, '<td valign="top">Thanks for aiming it over my shoulder and not right at my face!  Good shot.  Well thought out.  Good composition.</td>', 'Thanks for aiming it over my shoulder and not right at my face!  Good shot.  Well thought out.  Good composition.', '2002-10-14 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141968, 7099, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very wrathful.  I love the angle and framing/cropping of this shot.  I think that it is very nice.  I am thinking that it might be my computer, but the gun is in really great focus, with nice coloring, but the hand looks blotchy, like it lost something in the upload, or there was some post processing problems. I''m not going to take that into consideration when figuring my score, because my computer HAS been known to freak out on some photos, but if you feel it needs explaination, feel free to email me.  I do like the use of black and white here, and The positioning of the gun is very nice.  Having been raised around guns my entire life, this photo does not disturb me at all.  Great use of neg. space.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Very wrathful.  I love the angle and framing/cropping of this shot.  I think that it is very nice.  I am thinking that it might be my computer, but the gun is in really great focus, with nice coloring, but the hand looks blotchy, like it lost something in the upload, or there was some post processing problems. I''m not going to take that into consideration when figuring my score, because my computer HAS been known to freak out on some photos, but if you feel it needs explaination, feel free to email me.  I do like the use of black and white here, and The positioning of the gun is very nice.  Having been raised around guns my entire life, this photo does not disturb me at all.  Great use of neg. space.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-14 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(141969, 7099, 1856, '<td valign="top">Incredible photo! Technically superb...love the composition and negative space.  The one thing that kept this from a 10 is even though it''s of a gun in hand...wrath isn''t just jumping out at me.  Maybe if the hand were clenched more tightly I would see it more. 9 Lisa</td>', 'Incredible photo! Technically superb...love the composition and negative space.  The one thing that kept this from a 10 is even though it''s of a gun in hand...wrath isn''t just jumping out at me.  Maybe if the hand were clenched more tightly I would see it more. 9 Lisa', '2002-10-14 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
