(142010, 7100, 1143, '<td valign="top">This would do much better in a snapshot challenge or candid.  It''s one of those "found" shots that don''t usually do as well as the more controlled, artsy pics. It is a sad commentary on the American diet tho. Those look more like donuts than onion rings. They are HUGE!<br/>I''m not really sure how you could have improved it. Maybe taken it from the other side so you could see the mother''s expression and not cut off the boy''s knee.  Good Luck! ~indi</td>', 'This would do much better in a snapshot challenge or candid.  It''s one of those "found" shots that don''t usually do as well as the more controlled, artsy pics. It is a sad commentary on the American diet tho. Those look more like donuts than onion rings. They are HUGE!I''m not really sure how you could have improved it. Maybe taken it from the other side so you could see the mother''s expression and not cut off the boy''s knee.  Good Luck! ~indi', '2002-10-14 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
