(142273, 7108, 1779, '<td valign="top">Just a quick note to say Thanks to all of you who liked this photo (specially tha ones who commented on it). <br/><br/>A few weeks ago I decided to change my site preferences so that I couldn''t see my average during the week (I like surprises), and needless to say, this was a great one : )<br/><br/>Last but not least, thanks to my lovely wife for lending me her time (and legs) for this photo, and for letting me post it without hesitating. See, dear, it was woth it! Let''s do it again sometime...<br/><br/>Regarding the little details some of you mentioned (ie. the rug beeing intrusive and the oversaturated knees), you''re absolutely right, but since this wasn''t the original idea I just when crazy when I saw this posse and overlooked those things.<br/><br/>I''ll try it again to make it better and let you know in the forums.<br/><br/>Thanks again.<br/><br/>LM</td>', 'Just a quick note to say Thanks to all of you who liked this photo (specially tha ones who commented on it). A few weeks ago I decided to change my site preferences so that I couldn''t see my average during the week (I like surprises), and needless to say, this was a great one : )Last but not least, thanks to my lovely wife for lending me her time (and legs) for this photo, and for letting me post it without hesitating. See, dear, it was woth it! Let''s do it again sometime...Regarding the little details some of you mentioned (ie. the rug beeing intrusive and the oversaturated knees), you''re absolutely right, but since this wasn''t the original idea I just when crazy when I saw this posse and overlooked those things.I''ll try it again to make it better and let you know in the forums.Thanks again.LM', '2002-10-21 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
