(142303, 7109, 3669, '<td valign="top">I realize that each girl must be representing the seven sins, however, I think that it would be more dramatic for this photo to have each girl doing something or reacting as if the sin was committed.  As it is right now, it''s just seven lovely women all dressed alike posing on a cool stairway.  The shot itself is technically good.  Good focus and composition.  7</td>', 'I realize that each girl must be representing the seven sins, however, I think that it would be more dramatic for this photo to have each girl doing something or reacting as if the sin was committed.  As it is right now, it''s just seven lovely women all dressed alike posing on a cool stairway.  The shot itself is technically good.  Good focus and composition.  7', '2002-10-16 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
