(142358, 7111, 1005, '<td valign="top">Animal lust, it works for me.  Very good shot!  How did you get so close?  (Are you in Alaska or BC? you don''t have to answer that, I can wait)  If I had any kind of complaint, it would be nice to have the sun on their flanks, but asking them to "pose" would be silly (I know, people have asked me for that!)  9 Swash</td>', 'Animal lust, it works for me.  Very good shot!  How did you get so close?  (Are you in Alaska or BC? you don''t have to answer that, I can wait)  If I had any kind of complaint, it would be nice to have the sun on their flanks, but asking them to "pose" would be silly (I know, people have asked me for that!)  9 Swash', '2002-10-15 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142359, 7111, 2337, '<td valign="top">LoL, This doesn''t look like lust... Just look in his eyes... He really loves her :)  Nice catch... ~MyQyl~</td>', 'LoL, This doesn''t look like lust... Just look in his eyes... He really loves her :)  Nice catch... ~MyQyl~', '2002-10-15 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
