(142361, 7111, 1041, '<td valign="top">first reaction -- hm.  i really didn''t think sin applied to animals... but that''s just me.<br/>challenge -- met<br/>technical -- the bull and the cow''s face are too dark.  maybe try and increase the gamma in your photo editing software (if your software allows that).  i just increased it to 1.62 and i could see some more details.<br/>composition -- love how the elk cow is looking into the camera  :)  i wonder what a shallower DOF would''ve done to blur the background, but - if you are like me in these situations - you just fire on auto settings to make sure you get the shots  :)<br/>overall -- 5 from gr8photos</td>', 'first reaction -- hm.  i really didn''t think sin applied to animals... but that''s just me.challenge -- mettechnical -- the bull and the cow''s face are too dark.  maybe try and increase the gamma in your photo editing software (if your software allows that).  i just increased it to 1.62 and i could see some more details.composition -- love how the elk cow is looking into the camera  :)  i wonder what a shallower DOF would''ve done to blur the background, but - if you are like me in these situations - you just fire on auto settings to make sure you get the shots  :)overall -- 5 from gr8photos', '2002-10-16 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
