(142401, 7113, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo... the lighting is phenomenal.  I can''t really imagine that part of it being any better at all... it sets a great mood for the photo.  The only part that bugs me a little here is the composition.  The negative space on the right of the frame doesn''t work well for me.  I think this image would be a lot more powerful if the people ''slid'' to the right and left all the negative space on the left... great shot!!! = 9 - setzler</td>', 'This is a great photo... the lighting is phenomenal.  I can''t really imagine that part of it being any better at all... it sets a great mood for the photo.  The only part that bugs me a little here is the composition.  The negative space on the right of the frame doesn''t work well for me.  I think this image would be a lot more powerful if the people ''slid'' to the right and left all the negative space on the left... great shot!!! = 9 - setzler', '2002-10-14 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
