(142423, 7113, 811, '<td valign="top">I lvoe the shot. In looking at these pictures, I have tried to figure out what sin is being portrayed.  In this, it looks like he is wanting to get away, or looking at someone else, but she is holding on.  Maybe he is lusting, and she is envious.  Technically, (not that i''m qualified to comment) i think it is awesome.  The lighting sets the tone and makes it tense, as does the black and white.  10 karmat</td>', 'I lvoe the shot. In looking at these pictures, I have tried to figure out what sin is being portrayed.  In this, it looks like he is wanting to get away, or looking at someone else, but she is holding on.  Maybe he is lusting, and she is envious.  Technically, (not that i''m qualified to comment) i think it is awesome.  The lighting sets the tone and makes it tense, as does the black and white.  10 karmat', '2002-10-16 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
