(142441, 7113, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I''m seeing lust of wrath here.  They look like they are in an ambracing positions, however he looks like he''s ready to kill.  I would vote on wrath above anything here.  Eitherway, I feel it fits the challenge.  Your lighting is wonderful.  I really like how half the photo is lit and the other half fades into darkness.  Black and white works really nicely here.  I think that the focus is great and this is an overall very nice shot.  On another note, this looks exactly like a guy I went to school with years and years ago in MI.  Good shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Not sure if I''m seeing lust of wrath here.  They look like they are in an ambracing positions, however he looks like he''s ready to kill.  I would vote on wrath above anything here.  Eitherway, I feel it fits the challenge.  Your lighting is wonderful.  I really like how half the photo is lit and the other half fades into darkness.  Black and white works really nicely here.  I think that the focus is great and this is an overall very nice shot.  On another note, this looks exactly like a guy I went to school with years and years ago in MI.  Good shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-20 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
