(142448, 7113, 1037, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10. I didn''t really need to have a strong idea of which particular sin was there. The tension in the photo is suggestive of many, many things that are fundamental to the human condition (something that all the sins embody). The only thing that I don''t quite like is that it seems very staged, since the models are very photogenic, the hair is perfect, the girl''s makeup is perfect... I prefer realism, because those things make the emotions in the photo less powerful.</td>', 'I gave this a 10. I didn''t really need to have a strong idea of which particular sin was there. The tension in the photo is suggestive of many, many things that are fundamental to the human condition (something that all the sins embody). The only thing that I don''t quite like is that it seems very staged, since the models are very photogenic, the hair is perfect, the girl''s makeup is perfect... I prefer realism, because those things make the emotions in the photo less powerful.', '2002-10-22 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(142449, 7114, 4007, '<td valign="top">wow.. very cool idea and excelent shot. 10</td>', 'wow.. very cool idea and excelent shot. 10', '2002-10-14 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142450, 7114, 205, '<td valign="top">If only Hemmingway could see this now.</td>', 'If only Hemmingway could see this now.', '2002-10-14 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142451, 7114, 4267, '<td valign="top">very interesting photo.. looks like real blood too!</td>', 'very interesting photo.. looks like real blood too!', '2002-10-14 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142452, 7114, 327, '<td valign="top">Blaaahhh!! Fantastic. Very neat shot. Congrats. Justine</td>', 'Blaaahhh!! Fantastic. Very neat shot. Congrats. Justine', '2002-10-14 05:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142453, 7114, 3540, '<td valign="top">Pretty well taken photo.  I don''t like the theme particularly well though.  Good luck!</td>', 'Pretty well taken photo.  I don''t like the theme particularly well though.  Good luck!', '2002-10-14 06:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142454, 7114, 2553, '<td valign="top">In spite of the title, I fail to see a connection between grapes and "blood".  Also do not see a deadly sin, either directly portrayed or inferred. Composition is pretty good, but the photo overall, does not appeal to me.  lhall</td>', 'In spite of the title, I fail to see a connection between grapes and "blood".  Also do not see a deadly sin, either directly portrayed or inferred. Composition is pretty good, but the photo overall, does not appeal to me.  lhall', '2002-10-14 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142455, 7114, 2109, '<td valign="top">This photo rocks!! The upper left corner needs something, but lighting is good, and the concept blows my mind!  Well done, -9</td>', 'This photo rocks!! The upper left corner needs something, but lighting is good, and the concept blows my mind!  Well done, -9', '2002-10-14 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142456, 7114, 4430, '<td valign="top">Not only is this well taken but creative too.</td>', 'Not only is this well taken but creative too.', '2002-10-14 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142457, 7114, 3859, '<td valign="top">Really ugly!  But original!  I think I would have preferred strangulation of the grape!</td>', 'Really ugly!  But original!  I think I would have preferred strangulation of the grape!', '2002-10-14 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142458, 7114, 4564, '<td valign="top">OUh! :-) Great idea.  Great metaphore. I like the green and the red.  And the composition looks good. 7/10</td>', 'OUh! :-) Great idea.  Great metaphore. I like the green and the red.  And the composition looks good. 7/10', '2002-10-14 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142459, 7114, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like real blood.  If it isn''t, you have fooled me.  However, it IS almost halloween and those blood capsule things are everywhere, so hmmmm...  At any rate, really nice shot.  I think that you have done a great play on words here.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice and the lighting really makes the blood stand out.  Focus is nice.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'Looks like real blood.  If it isn''t, you have fooled me.  However, it IS almost halloween and those blood capsule things are everywhere, so hmmmm...  At any rate, really nice shot.  I think that you have done a great play on words here.  The angle and framing/cropping are nice and the lighting really makes the blood stand out.  Focus is nice.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-10-14 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142460, 7114, 3464, '<td valign="top">Yuck! Very effective, good color and clarity</td>', 'Yuck! Very effective, good color and clarity', '2002-10-14 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142461, 7114, 4388, '<td valign="top">sick, but doesn''t make me think of sin.</td>', 'sick, but doesn''t make me think of sin.', '2002-10-14 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142462, 7114, 368, '<td valign="top">very clever play on words ... good job .... 7-photosbyayme</td>', 'very clever play on words ... good job .... 7-photosbyayme', '2002-10-15 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142463, 7114, 4378, '<td valign="top">i though u said " no grapes were harmed during the filming of this commercial".har..har..just kidding, very tense man.   score-8</td>', 'i though u said " no grapes were harmed during the filming of this commercial".har..har..just kidding, very tense man.   score-8', '2002-10-15 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142464, 7114, 3936, '<td valign="top">Allright!  Imagination, composition, exposure, focus, lighting!  10!</td>', 'Allright!  Imagination, composition, exposure, focus, lighting!  10!', '2002-10-15 23:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142465, 7114, 4596, '<td valign="top">Gives pause for thought. Is more on topic then the vast bulk of submissions. Great composition and contrast. Artistry in abundance.</td>', 'Gives pause for thought. Is more on topic then the vast bulk of submissions. Great composition and contrast. Artistry in abundance.', '2002-10-16 09:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142466, 7114, 3669, '<td valign="top">Awesome use of the challange.  Also, you made really good blood...looks very real.</td>', 'Awesome use of the challange.  Also, you made really good blood...looks very real.', '2002-10-16 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142467, 7114, 4648, '<td valign="top">Very good quality photograph.  Not fair that I know it''s yours.  I like the blemish on the one grape.  Adds to the photo.  Subtle difference of colors in grapes also good.</td>', 'Very good quality photograph.  Not fair that I know it''s yours.  I like the blemish on the one grape.  Adds to the photo.  Subtle difference of colors in grapes also good.', '2002-10-17 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142468, 7114, 436, '<td valign="top">eww.  i''d never have thought of that!</td>', 'eww.  i''d never have thought of that!', '2002-10-17 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
