(142479, 7115, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job.  Grayce</td>', 'Good job.  Grayce', '2002-10-14 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142480, 7115, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice job!!  I think you executed this well. It works in B&amp;W - gives it more severity. The placement of the piece of paper seems a little strange...like he''s holding it up just for the camera. Could have worked without it probably just as well. Overall, it''s a great pic and fits the challenge well. ~indi</td>', 'Nice job!!  I think you executed this well. It works in B&W - gives it more severity. The placement of the piece of paper seems a little strange...like he''s holding it up just for the camera. Could have worked without it probably just as well. Overall, it''s a great pic and fits the challenge well. ~indi', '2002-10-14 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142481, 7115, 4098, '<td valign="top">Great shot, it''s controversial and I like it.  Great B&amp;W tone, sharp details, everything is in focus.  Good luck in the challenge.   10</td>', 'Great shot, it''s controversial and I like it.  Great B&W tone, sharp details, everything is in focus.  Good luck in the challenge.   10', '2002-10-14 03:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142482, 7115, 327, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot. Like it. Good luck Justine</td>', 'Stunning shot. Like it. Good luck Justine', '2002-10-14 05:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142483, 7115, 2553, '<td valign="top">Definitely an evocative shot.  You''ve definitely nailed the challenge subject, (or at least one or two of them). lhall</td>', 'Definitely an evocative shot.  You''ve definitely nailed the challenge subject, (or at least one or two of them). lhall', '2002-10-14 07:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142484, 7115, 1826, '<td valign="top">Powerful shot and concept. 10 Kaz</td>', 'Powerful shot and concept. 10 Kaz', '2002-10-14 07:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142485, 7115, 4106, '<td valign="top">powerful image</td>', 'powerful image', '2002-10-14 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142486, 7115, 811, '<td valign="top">Powerful.  The picture has a grain to it that I normally wouldn''t like, but it adds to the tension, I think, of this picture.  karmat</td>', 'Powerful.  The picture has a grain to it that I normally wouldn''t like, but it adds to the tension, I think, of this picture.  karmat', '2002-10-14 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142487, 7115, 1255, '<td valign="top">I understand putting the Boston Globe article in the shot for context, but it seems kind of shoved in and a bit distracting.  The man seems to be reading the article rather than meditating on/repenting for his sins as the cross and posture indicate.</td>', 'I understand putting the Boston Globe article in the shot for context, but it seems kind of shoved in and a bit distracting.  The man seems to be reading the article rather than meditating on/repenting for his sins as the cross and posture indicate.', '2002-10-14 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142488, 7115, 4430, '<td valign="top">I think I like everything about this, choice of b/w, framing, and definitly fits theme.</td>', 'I think I like everything about this, choice of b/w, framing, and definitly fits theme.', '2002-10-14 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142489, 7115, 3672, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background 8 , Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7 , Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7, Total Averaged Rating 7 .  smshats</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background 8 , Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7 , Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7, Total Averaged Rating 7 .  smshats', '2002-10-14 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142490, 7115, 1856, '<td valign="top">Lust, right? :)  Love the use of black and white...brings out the 3 important objects in the frame..the color, the cross, and the scandal...which happen to comprise a lovely triangle.  2 nitpicks...position of paper makes this look somewhat setup...and the palm of his hand being lighter and smooth in the middle of darkness/texture is a little distracting.  8 Lisa</td>', 'Lust, right? :)  Love the use of black and white...brings out the 3 important objects in the frame..the color, the cross, and the scandal...which happen to comprise a lovely triangle.  2 nitpicks...position of paper makes this look somewhat setup...and the palm of his hand being lighter and smooth in the middle of darkness/texture is a little distracting.  8 Lisa', '2002-10-14 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142491, 7115, 4388, '<td valign="top">great photo but you shouldn''t have to explain it with the paper.</td>', 'great photo but you shouldn''t have to explain it with the paper.', '2002-10-14 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142492, 7115, 4361, '<td valign="top">if u dont know the truth then dont hate</td>', 'if u dont know the truth then dont hate', '2002-10-15 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142493, 7115, 1897, '<td valign="top">There is something about the lighting I do not really care for, but this is a good concept, it definitely gets the point across 7 Zeiss</td>', 'There is something about the lighting I do not really care for, but this is a good concept, it definitely gets the point across 7 Zeiss', '2002-10-15 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142494, 7115, 3080, '<td valign="top">Excelent.  Great focus and clarity.  You have the perfect focus on the paper so we can see the message there. The way he is positioned, really creates the mood.  I have given this a 9, but as I think about it, I''m now trying to figure out which of the 7 sins this represents.  The abuse could represent wrath...ok, I get it.  Lust.  This is in relation to the sex abuse scandals from clergy.  nevermind me, just thinking out loud. lol.  Your angle and framing/cropping are excelent.  Lighting is wonderful, and I really like the use of black and white here.  I''m a little slow, but I got it. LOL Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Excelent.  Great focus and clarity.  You have the perfect focus on the paper so we can see the message there. The way he is positioned, really creates the mood.  I have given this a 9, but as I think about it, I''m now trying to figure out which of the 7 sins this represents.  The abuse could represent wrath...ok, I get it.  Lust.  This is in relation to the sex abuse scandals from clergy.  nevermind me, just thinking out loud. lol.  Your angle and framing/cropping are excelent.  Lighting is wonderful, and I really like the use of black and white here.  I''m a little slow, but I got it. LOL Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-15 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142495, 7115, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good clean depiction of subject.  Good black &amp; White</td>', 'Good clean depiction of subject.  Good black & White', '2002-10-15 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142496, 7115, 2337, '<td valign="top">Concept was good, but there''s something in the execution that bothers me.  It seems overly ''adjusted'' in contrast or sharpness or something... Not sure what exactly.  ~MyQyl~</td>', 'Concept was good, but there''s something in the execution that bothers me.  It seems overly ''adjusted'' in contrast or sharpness or something... Not sure what exactly.  ~MyQyl~', '2002-10-15 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142497, 7115, 2586, '<td valign="top">Powerful image. Good choice of B&amp;W. The pose of the priest is convincing and adds to the theme. What I find terribly, terribly distracting and marring the image is that Boston Globe piece of paper. It is so terribly contrived and it just sits there to tell the viewer the story: but the story is told very well without it by the image and underscored by the title. 7 Journey</td>', 'Powerful image. Good choice of B&W. The pose of the priest is convincing and adds to the theme. What I find terribly, terribly distracting and marring the image is that Boston Globe piece of paper. It is so terribly contrived and it just sits there to tell the viewer the story: but the story is told very well without it by the image and underscored by the title. 7 Journey', '2002-10-16 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142498, 7115, 3669, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this photo.  I also like the image and emotion it emits.  However, I don''t really like the graininess of it.  I feel that B&amp;W is appropriate for the mood, but more clarity would be better.  Otherwise, I really like it and, you know, when I look at the thumbnail, it''s much better.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this photo.  I also like the image and emotion it emits.  However, I don''t really like the graininess of it.  I feel that B&W is appropriate for the mood, but more clarity would be better.  Otherwise, I really like it and, you know, when I look at the thumbnail, it''s much better.', '2002-10-16 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142499, 7115, 255, '<td valign="top">this is great. i love the lighting, the composition and the graininess. i really cant decide tho if i would like this even more with out the paper, even though that is really an irrelevant statement! nice job here! 9--alecia</td>', 'this is great. i love the lighting, the composition and the graininess. i really cant decide tho if i would like this even more with out the paper, even though that is really an irrelevant statement! nice job here! 9--alecia', '2002-10-16 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142500, 7115, 4615, '<td valign="top">Topical</td>', 'Topical', '2002-10-16 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142501, 7115, 1827, '<td valign="top">Everything about the composition of this works for me except the placement of the paper.  It doesn''t seem placed in such a way that he can be reading it.  I thought at first that maybe it was the front page of an open newspaper, but that doesn''t appear to be the case.  The emotion of what you''ve depicted is well-represented in his expression and body-language.  The thing that most damages my ability to appreciate the photo is the pixellation.  There is the school of thought that at times pixellation adds something to the nitty-gritty nature of a photo, but it''s a school of thought I have a hard time relating to.  Just passing this on so you''ll know there are people who probably feel it''s beneficial and those who feel it''s detrimental.  THat said, if it wasn''t intentional, you may have been able to avoid SOME pixellation by not compressing so much.  Your image can be up to 150K.  Take what you can use, disregard the rest, 6, just-married</td>', 'Everything about the composition of this works for me except the placement of the paper.  It doesn''t seem placed in such a way that he can be reading it.  I thought at first that maybe it was the front page of an open newspaper, but that doesn''t appear to be the case.  The emotion of what you''ve depicted is well-represented in his expression and body-language.  The thing that most damages my ability to appreciate the photo is the pixellation.  There is the school of thought that at times pixellation adds something to the nitty-gritty nature of a photo, but it''s a school of thought I have a hard time relating to.  Just passing this on so you''ll know there are people who probably feel it''s beneficial and those who feel it''s detrimental.  THat said, if it wasn''t intentional, you may have been able to avoid SOME pixellation by not compressing so much.  Your image can be up to 150K.  Take what you can use, disregard the rest, 6, just-married', '2002-10-17 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142502, 7115, 3317, '<td valign="top">how''d you set this up? better tell stories after the challenge is over.</td>', 'how''d you set this up? better tell stories after the challenge is over.', '2002-10-17 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142503, 7115, 4162, '<td valign="top">Great composition!  Not sure how this has been taken though, TV? It looks a bit grainy.</td>', 'Great composition!  Not sure how this has been taken though, TV? It looks a bit grainy.', '2002-10-17 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142504, 7115, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-10-18 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142505, 7115, 570, '<td valign="top">can''t fall from a place you never were.</td>', 'can''t fall from a place you never were.', '2002-10-18 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142506, 7115, 1005, '<td valign="top">Karen, sorry I didn''t get around to commenting on this photo.  It is great!  I gave you an 8 strictly on the right hand.  For some reason, it just doesn''t look good on my monitor, kinda like it was somebody else''s hand.  This is a great photo and a better statement.  You should be very proud.  Rob</td>', 'Karen, sorry I didn''t get around to commenting on this photo.  It is great!  I gave you an 8 strictly on the right hand.  For some reason, it just doesn''t look good on my monitor, kinda like it was somebody else''s hand.  This is a great photo and a better statement.  You should be very proud.  Rob', '2002-10-21 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(142507, 7115, 1037, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10. Very topical and dramatic. You were very brave, because I know there is a lot of tension and high emotion about this subject.</td>', 'I gave this a 10. Very topical and dramatic. You were very brave, because I know there is a lot of tension and high emotion about this subject.', '2002-10-22 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(142508, 7116, 2279, '<td valign="top">Whoa. :)</td>', 'Whoa. :)', '2002-10-14 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142509, 7116, 4098, '<td valign="top">Being a "big guy" myself, I find this a little bit too "easy".  As a snapshot it''s not too bad but the focus seems a little bit off.</td>', 'Being a "big guy" myself, I find this a little bit too "easy".  As a snapshot it''s not too bad but the focus seems a little bit off.', '2002-10-14 04:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142510, 7116, 1003, '<td valign="top">oh yah..........for sure.</td>', 'oh yah..........for sure.', '2002-10-14 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142511, 7116, 2716, '<td valign="top">I find the following things distracting: overall lack of focus, flash in the window,  the red text in the background, the leg on the right side, the reflected light in the right corner, the guys on the left.   Nice try though. 2.  I hope you''re not offended.</td>', 'I find the following things distracting: overall lack of focus, flash in the window,  the red text in the background, the leg on the right side, the reflected light in the right corner, the guys on the left.   Nice try though. 2.  I hope you''re not offended.', '2002-10-14 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142512, 7116, 3859, '<td valign="top">I think if you cropped out the leg on the right side of the photo, it would look a bit better.</td>', 'I think if you cropped out the leg on the right side of the photo, it would look a bit better.', '2002-10-14 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142513, 7116, 4564, '<td valign="top">On par with the theme. Framing cuol dbe a lot better though.  Why not ask the guys to come pose in a controlled environment to get better lighting as well?  Bellow average... 4/10</td>', 'On par with the theme. Framing cuol dbe a lot better though.  Why not ask the guys to come pose in a controlled environment to get better lighting as well?  Bellow average... 4/10', '2002-10-14 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
