(142608, 7119, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition (adn subject!) of this.  I think it would have had some added punch if you could have found a way to include a strawberry or something red with the candies.  Then,  a "triangle" would have been set up, and made a complete pattern for the eyes.  As it is, the eyes go from the one on the left, to the one on the right, and then have nowhere else to go.  <br/>Dang, you''ve made me hungry! karmat</td>', 'I like the composition (adn subject!) of this.  I think it would have had some added punch if you could have found a way to include a strawberry or something red with the candies.  Then,  a "triangle" would have been set up, and made a complete pattern for the eyes.  As it is, the eyes go from the one on the left, to the one on the right, and then have nowhere else to go.  Dang, you''ve made me hungry! karmat', '2002-10-14 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142609, 7119, 3669, '<td valign="top">Oh, VERY SINFUL.  Looks scrumptious!  I hope you enjoyed indulging in your prompts after your photo shoot.  Where''s the fork and spoon?  Nice composition.  The strawberries are a nice touch.  The whipped cream gets a little lost in the white background.  9</td>', 'Oh, VERY SINFUL.  Looks scrumptious!  I hope you enjoyed indulging in your prompts after your photo shoot.  Where''s the fork and spoon?  Nice composition.  The strawberries are a nice touch.  The whipped cream gets a little lost in the white background.  9', '2002-10-15 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
