(142613, 7119, 3859, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo.  Could be used for an ad. Although, I believe what you must be going for is a Sinful Delight type idea, my first impression when looking at this pretty food is not sin.  But then, that''s when sin can be most insidious --<br/>when it can''t be recognized. So,I''m back to your title, Good or Bad.  Good job!</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo.  Could be used for an ad. Although, I believe what you must be going for is a Sinful Delight type idea, my first impression when looking at this pretty food is not sin.  But then, that''s when sin can be most insidious --when it can''t be recognized. So,I''m back to your title, Good or Bad.  Good job!', '2002-10-15 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
