(142721, 7123, 3080, '<td valign="top">I can see this as gluttony.  Nice portrayal.  I love the focus in this shot.  The sharp focus being on the front and the narrow dof wrks well here.  Composition is nice.  This is a photo I could see on a wall in a fine resteraunt.  lighting is great.  I really like the rich color of these.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I can see this as gluttony.  Nice portrayal.  I love the focus in this shot.  The sharp focus being on the front and the narrow dof wrks well here.  Composition is nice.  This is a photo I could see on a wall in a fine resteraunt.  lighting is great.  I really like the rich color of these.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-10-20 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
