(142734, 7124, 3932, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I love the symbolism that you''ve portrayed.  It seems to maybe be a hair overexposed. This would be a very nice shot with a little work.  Maybe less intensity from the light, so cause the backdrop to be even darker... to where the apples and Eve figure seemed to be just in a "void."  It looks to be a tough lighting situation... -   6  -   JB</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I love the symbolism that you''ve portrayed.  It seems to maybe be a hair overexposed. This would be a very nice shot with a little work.  Maybe less intensity from the light, so cause the backdrop to be even darker... to where the apples and Eve figure seemed to be just in a "void."  It looks to be a tough lighting situation... -   6  -   JB', '2002-10-14 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
