(142746, 7124, 2221, '<td valign="top">I think focus and lighting don''t match. Your focus is on the statue in the background but your lighting highlights the apples in the front. That''s why I would like the photo better without the flash(?) light on the apples and more light on the statue. I also think one apple would be enough. More just distract too much. -stephan</td>', 'I think focus and lighting don''t match. Your focus is on the statue in the background but your lighting highlights the apples in the front. That''s why I would like the photo better without the flash(?) light on the apples and more light on the statue. I also think one apple would be enough. More just distract too much. -stephan', '2002-10-20 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
