(142749, 7124, 2527, '<td valign="top">The concept was nice... but my execution... lousy!!!! ;(<br/>Anyway... thanks for the feedback you gave me this week...<br/>I''ll promise to do better this week! <br/>This will go to my fans! ;)<br/>There was no flash in the photo... it was a lamp actually, but i was too close to the object... i learn my lesson...<br/>Eve was the "original sin" however she commited one of the seven sins wrath.<br/>There are 7 apples... but 1 of the apples seems to be part of the others... take a close look!<br/>Well once again... Thank you very much!<br/>Richi</td>', 'The concept was nice... but my execution... lousy!!!! ;(Anyway... thanks for the feedback you gave me this week...I''ll promise to do better this week! This will go to my fans! ;)There was no flash in the photo... it was a lamp actually, but i was too close to the object... i learn my lesson...Eve was the "original sin" however she commited one of the seven sins wrath.There are 7 apples... but 1 of the apples seems to be part of the others... take a close look!Well once again... Thank you very much!Richi', '2002-10-21 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(142750, 7125, 1143, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is really good. Can''t fault the focus or exposure. I''m not sure the idea has been executed as well as you would like. I was a little unsure about what is being broken. Still, after all the fuzzy, thoughtless pics I''m going through... I appreciate hitting some like this.  ~indi</td>', 'Technically, this is really good. Can''t fault the focus or exposure. I''m not sure the idea has been executed as well as you would like. I was a little unsure about what is being broken. Still, after all the fuzzy, thoughtless pics I''m going through... I appreciate hitting some like this.  ~indi', '2002-10-14 03:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
