(142893, 7129, 3575, '<td valign="top">Oh, oh, there''s a little guy coming up from the bottom to try to steal the meal! I would have liked more DOF and sharper focus on the ant on the top. I like the composition and the creativity.</td>', 'Oh, oh, there''s a little guy coming up from the bottom to try to steal the meal! I would have liked more DOF and sharper focus on the ant on the top. I like the composition and the creativity.', '2002-10-16 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
