(142896, 7129, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite image this week - fun, quirky and colourful, interesting shapes (in the ants, the sweet and the gravel), good lighting, good choice of DOF and a fun way to express "eyes bigger than your belly" greed. <br/>Preliminary score = 9 (I''ll keep coming back to it during the rest of the week and if it grows on me a little more and I dream of owning a copy, I''ll bump to 10).<br/>Kavey</td>', 'This is my favourite image this week - fun, quirky and colourful, interesting shapes (in the ants, the sweet and the gravel), good lighting, good choice of DOF and a fun way to express "eyes bigger than your belly" greed. Preliminary score = 9 (I''ll keep coming back to it during the rest of the week and if it grows on me a little more and I dream of owning a copy, I''ll bump to 10).Kavey', '2002-10-17 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
