(142931, 7131, 2923, '<td valign="top">Is this Gordon? :)  just wondering -- gutsy shot, i don''t like it cuz i am an American, but it is a good deliverable message, and very well constructed  Nice backlighting, technically decent.  if it wasn''t for the anti-american thing, i''d given you higher but hey, that''s my preference :)  gutsy shot, probably will get some good votes from foreigners but bad votes from Americans. I''ll give you a 8 paganini</td>', 'Is this Gordon? :)  just wondering -- gutsy shot, i don''t like it cuz i am an American, but it is a good deliverable message, and very well constructed  Nice backlighting, technically decent.  if it wasn''t for the anti-american thing, i''d given you higher but hey, that''s my preference :)  gutsy shot, probably will get some good votes from foreigners but bad votes from Americans. I''ll give you a 8 paganini', '2002-10-14 04:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
