(142934, 7131, 917, '<td valign="top">The hand disappears behind the dark background, and the light is showing from behind the head.<br/><br/>You could also have done more by borrowing from Nazi/Communist imagery. Try using a model with short hair and a powerful physique, or use a middle aged businessman (Stormtroopers of the capitalist hedgemony!) as that would make a statement too. You need to lose the T-Shirt.</td>', 'The hand disappears behind the dark background, and the light is showing from behind the head.You could also have done more by borrowing from Nazi/Communist imagery. Try using a model with short hair and a powerful physique, or use a middle aged businessman (Stormtroopers of the capitalist hedgemony!) as that would make a statement too. You need to lose the T-Shirt.', '2002-10-14 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142935, 7131, 1041, '<td valign="top">initial reaction -- we have become too proud? wrathful?  not sure i''m getting exactly which sin you are depicting.<br/>challenge -- met<br/>technical -- good use of silhouette.  if the light source was just a little lower, it wouldn''t give you the blowout directly abov the head.  not sure what he is holding in the hand.  if that''s crucial to the photo, you''d maybe have your model kneeling down and the photograph from the floor up to get the same angle, but the hand in front of the flag and not melting into the background.<br/>composition -- straight on works here.  some distracting stuff to the sides of the flag at the top, maybe a 640x427 could''ve eliminated that.<br/>overall -- 5 from gr8photos</td>', 'initial reaction -- we have become too proud? wrathful?  not sure i''m getting exactly which sin you are depicting.challenge -- mettechnical -- good use of silhouette.  if the light source was just a little lower, it wouldn''t give you the blowout directly abov the head.  not sure what he is holding in the hand.  if that''s crucial to the photo, you''d maybe have your model kneeling down and the photograph from the floor up to get the same angle, but the hand in front of the flag and not melting into the background.composition -- straight on works here.  some distracting stuff to the sides of the flag at the top, maybe a 640x427 could''ve eliminated that.overall -- 5 from gr8photos', '2002-10-14 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(142936, 7131, 3859, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, become what?</td>', 'I''m sorry, become what?', '2002-10-14 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
