(143126, 7139, 4596, '<td valign="top">Fire is always beautiful and so fluid. I just wish I knew what what going up in flames and the symbolism of the shot. Nice colors, maybe even a good statement here somewhere. But then, the theme of the photo escapes me.</td>', 'Fire is always beautiful and so fluid. I just wish I knew what what going up in flames and the symbolism of the shot. Nice colors, maybe even a good statement here somewhere. But then, the theme of the photo escapes me.', '2002-10-14 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
