(143173, 7141, 4596, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that a healthy, relatively slender woman sharnig an Asian meal is a sign of gluttony, but then it''s hard to see which plate she has plucked a bite from. I like the composition and colour and the soft focus sheen. Gluttony, if that is what you were going for, would have been better reflected by an open mouth, more action, and a sense/hint of greed. Here, it almost looks like she is being reflective, and not at all passionate about her food.</td>', 'I''m not sure that a healthy, relatively slender woman sharnig an Asian meal is a sign of gluttony, but then it''s hard to see which plate she has plucked a bite from. I like the composition and colour and the soft focus sheen. Gluttony, if that is what you were going for, would have been better reflected by an open mouth, more action, and a sense/hint of greed. Here, it almost looks like she is being reflective, and not at all passionate about her food.', '2002-10-14 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(143174, 7141, 117, '<td valign="top">reflection and movement in this image--softness saves a the image--i like the colors--6bobgaither</td>', 'reflection and movement in this image--softness saves a the image--i like the colors--6bobgaither', '2002-10-14 02:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
