(143185, 7141, 2079, '<td valign="top">Generally speaking, ?soft? photos have not rated well with the voters here on DPChallenge. I sincerely hope the voters give this on the credit it deserves. This is one of the most ideal examples of a well shot capture with an excellent utilization of a soft focus. A beautiful subject, fabulous color ? and it meets the challenge too. Good luck with this one I hope you do well ? Gotcha   8</td>', 'Generally speaking, ?soft? photos have not rated well with the voters here on DPChallenge. I sincerely hope the voters give this on the credit it deserves. This is one of the most ideal examples of a well shot capture with an excellent utilization of a soft focus. A beautiful subject, fabulous color ? and it meets the challenge too. Good luck with this one I hope you do well ? Gotcha   8', '2002-10-16 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
