(286911, 7029, 7570, '<td valign="top">Having the same camera as yours, I''m pretty sure you could do much better on the focus. Try making use of the Macro mode for shots like these, it helps. As a thumbnail this photo looks deliciously nice, but once blown-up the focus really makes me "lose appetite". Cheers.</td>', 'Having the same camera as yours, I''m pretty sure you could do much better on the focus. Try making use of the Macro mode for shots like these, it helps. As a thumbnail this photo looks deliciously nice, but once blown-up the focus really makes me "lose appetite". Cheers.', '2003-05-04 03:41:41.000000', NULL, 0),
