(4787299, 6943, 90947, '<td valign="top">I see you suffered some of the same sort of pro/con wrath I did with my crime scene challenge entry.  <br/> <br/>I agree that this is a top flight journalism photo.  It always helps to be in the right place at the right time.  Very well exposed, and you got a good <i>typically smirky</i> expression.  <br/> <br/>I will admit that my feeling about this man would likely have negatively impacted a vote I might have placed had I been in this group at the time.  I hope it wouldn''t have.  Regardless of how one might feel about the this person, this is an excellent photograph.<br/> <br/>Bye the way... you missed arrogance.  ;-)</td>', 'I see you suffered some of the same sort of pro/con wrath I did with my crime scene challenge entry.   I agree that this is a top flight journalism photo.  It always helps to be in the right place at the right time.  Very well exposed, and you got a good typically smirky expression.   I will admit that my feeling about this man would likely have negatively impacted a vote I might have placed had I been in this group at the time.  I hope it wouldn''t have.  Regardless of how one might feel about the this person, this is an excellent photograph. Bye the way... you missed arrogance.  ;-)', '2008-06-26 20:18:58.000000', NULL, 0),
